asr-000136
00:35:50.100 --> 00:35:51.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: Do our...

asr-000137
00:35:51.820 --> 00:35:57.620
Senator Joel Villanueva: ...job here so we can be more effective and more efficient in delivering services to our people.

asr-000138
00:35:57.800 --> 00:36:00.620
Senator Joel Villanueva: Let me give the floor to our chairperson, Chairman J.V. Arcito.

asr-000139
00:36:01.040 --> 00:36:11.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Mr. Chairman. Magandang hapon po sa lahat to the CHED and the SUCs from different parts of the country.

asr-000140
00:36:11.960 --> 00:36:13.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Magandang hapon po sa inyong lahat.

asr-000141
00:36:14.020 --> 00:36:17.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Anyway, first of all, I'd like to thank all of you for coming over.

asr-000142
00:36:17.320 --> 00:36:20.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It's been a very hectic week.

asr-000143
00:36:21.160 --> 00:36:21.800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hectic day.

asr-000144
00:36:21.820 --> 00:36:24.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: For us in the Senate, ongoing on-commissioned appointments.

asr-000145
00:36:25.000 --> 00:36:29.440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I'm also chairing the budget of the Department of Public Works right now.

asr-000146
00:36:30.040 --> 00:36:34.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But we took a break so that I can join you for a while.

asr-000147
00:36:34.520 --> 00:36:41.960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I'll try to join you. Hopefully, we can wrap up, Mr. Chair, earlier sa DPWH budget so that we can...

asr-000148
