asr-000149
00:36:45.700 --> 00:36:46.140
Senator Joel Villanueva: Yes.

asr-000150
00:36:47.800 --> 00:36:50.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Because we know for a fact that we are both...

asr-000151
00:36:51.820 --> 00:36:57.500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Advocates and we have been very supportive of our higher education, especially the SUCs.

asr-000152
00:36:58.500 --> 00:37:01.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Una sa, I'll just give, go to my opening statement.

asr-000153
00:37:01.680 --> 00:37:03.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Magandang hapon po sa ating mga kasamahan.

asr-000154
00:37:04.520 --> 00:37:11.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siyempre sa ating pong chairman, sa Central Joel Villanueva, sa mga kinatawa na Commission Higher Education.

asr-000155
00:37:12.200 --> 00:37:18.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siyempre sa kay, of course, kay Ma'am Shirley Agrupis, sa kanya pong mga kasamahan, commissioners.

asr-000156
00:37:19.540 --> 00:37:21.800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At sa ating pong State Universities Colleges.

asr-000157
00:37:21.820 --> 00:37:23.000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At sa lahat ng narinito.

asr-000158
00:37:23.540 --> 00:37:31.680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At the outset of our budget deliberations for Fiscal Year 2027, I emphasize that our guiding principle is simple, back to basics.

asr-000159
00:37:32.340 --> 00:37:38.460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Today, as you take up the proposed budgets of CHED and our SUCs, we carry that same principles with us.

asr-000160
00:37:39.100 --> 00:37:48.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We must focus on our resources and what our students need to enter college, stay in school, and graduate with the knowledge and skills to build a better future.

asr-000161
00:37:48.820 --> 00:37:51.800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Para sa maraming pamilyang Pilipinas,

asr-000162
00:37:51.820 --> 00:37:58.960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: mayroon ang makapagtapos ng koleyo ang pangarap na pinagsisikapan at pinaglaanan ng malaking sakripisyo.

asr-000163
00:37:59.760 --> 00:38:10.480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nung mayroon pa ako nasanuan, isa sa mga pinagmamlaking proyekto hanggang sa ngayon ay ang pagkakatatag na isang campus ng Polytechnic University of the Philippines.

asr-000164
00:38:10.480 --> 00:38:20.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Having been able to establish an SUC for our small city was one of the biggest accomplishments that I'm still proud of.

asr-000165
00:38:21.820 --> 00:38:33.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa aming mga kababayan, pagka-hugout and high school, maraming mga poor but deserving, kaya lang tumatawid pa ng ibang siyudad para makapagpatuloy ng koleyo.

asr-000166
00:38:33.640 --> 00:38:51.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya nga, binabuti natin na mag-establish ng SUC, isang state college, with the agreement with the PUP, and I'm very proud that right now our pioneer class, when I was there now, are holding exams.

asr-000167
00:38:51.820 --> 00:39:07.180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, I'm still proud of, probably when I wrap up my career later on, I'll still be very much proud of having been able to establish a state university in our own city.

asr-000168
00:39:07.340 --> 00:39:21.800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Alam natin na para sa maraming pamilya, malaking bagay ang pagkakaroon ng abot-kayang koleyo na malapit sa tahanan, nababawasan ng gastos mga masahe at tirahan, at nagiging mas abot kamay ang pangarap na makakaroon.

asr-000169
00:39:21.820 --> 00:39:31.180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At ang sakit po kasi, paniniwala ko po siya, Chair, if you have a graduate per family, that gives them a chance to up-dip the living conditions of their family.

asr-000170
00:39:31.420 --> 00:39:40.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Isang graduate sa bawat pamilya, pagkakataon na may ahon sa kahirapan at mabigyan ng magandang kalidad ng buhay ang kanilang pamilya.

asr-000171
00:39:40.680 --> 00:39:50.600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: To our public higher education institutions and student assistance programs, we have opened more opportunities for our young people, but our responsibility continues beyond enrollment.

asr-000172
00:39:51.820 --> 00:39:57.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kailan nating tiyakin na may sapat na suporta ang ating mga estudyante hanggang sa kanilang pagtatapos.

asr-000173
00:39:58.100 --> 00:40:03.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We also want our higher education institutions to respond to the needs of our communities and our economy.

asr-000174
00:40:03.960 --> 00:40:14.340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This means relevant curricula, meaningful research, strong industry linkages, and extension services that bring knowledge and practical solutions to the people.

asr-000175
00:40:15.120 --> 00:40:21.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa pagtatalakay natin sa mga panukalang budget, susuriin natin kung sapat ang pondo para sa mga pangunan.

asr-000176
00:40:21.820 --> 00:40:31.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At kung kaya ito magamit ng maayos at nasa oras, at kung malinaw ang mga resulta ang inaasa natin.

asr-000177
00:40:31.760 --> 00:40:43.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Every peso we allocate must help bring our students closer to getting to the finish line by graduating and finding better opportunities in life not just for themselves, but for their families.

asr-000178
00:40:43.800 --> 00:40:50.620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yan po ang layunin natin, isang higher education system na abot kaya, may kalidad, at tumutugod sa pangangailangan ng ating bansa.

asr-000179
00:40:50.620 --> 00:40:51.800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya lang po, Mr. Chair.

asr-000180
00:40:51.820 --> 00:41:02.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ah, Senator Aquino is here also, one of our colleagues who is very much, very supportive of education, especially the higher education.

asr-000181
00:41:03.060 --> 00:41:11.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Because of our very, very, as Chairman of the Finance, siguro sabihin ko lang po sa inyo that we will try our best to give what we can give.

asr-000182
00:41:11.840 --> 00:41:15.960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya lang talagang very limited ho ang ating fiscal space this year.

asr-000183
00:41:16.140 --> 00:41:20.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Na talagang yung elbow room natin, napakaliit.

asr-000184
00:41:20.320 --> 00:41:25.160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Because of our economic situation, alam nyo naman siguro yung nangyari nung isang taon.

asr-000185
00:41:25.780 --> 00:41:38.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: That's why this early, I beg for your indulgence and understanding na kung hindi man natin maibigay yung mga wish po natin, kung kaya naman, dahan-dahanin po siguro natin.

asr-000186
00:41:38.280 --> 00:41:46.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Basta, nirecommend po ng ating Vice Chair, Senator Aquino, yung mga advocates dito, but kaya, pag kaya po, ay gagawan po natin ang paraan.

asr-000187
00:41:46.740 --> 00:41:49.440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang problema lang, sinasabi ko na po sa inyo.

asr-000188
00:41:50.320 --> 00:41:56.400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, ang aming dilema sa ngayon, kung pwede lang mapagbigyan lahat ng SUCs, pagbibigyan natin.

asr-000189
00:41:56.540 --> 00:42:03.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya lang, dahil sa nangyaring flood control scandal, apektado po ang buong ekonomiya na ating bansa.

asr-000190
00:42:04.520 --> 00:42:10.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Bumagsak po ang revenue natin, bumagsak ang koleksyon, bumagsak din ang GTP.

asr-000191
00:42:10.840 --> 00:42:15.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: From 5% to 4% last year, now it's down to 2%.

asr-000192
00:42:15.060 --> 00:42:16.920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, kinakailangan din natin humabol.

asr-000193
00:42:17.440 --> 00:42:18.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, hopefully, makabawi ngayon.

asr-000194
00:42:18.660 --> 00:42:20.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, but we will see.

asr-000195
00:42:21.300 --> 00:42:22.340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We will do our part.

asr-000196
00:42:22.480 --> 00:42:31.680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pag tutulungan namin ni Sen. Joel Villanueva, Senator Bam Aquino, kung ano po yung talagang kailangan para mapanatili natin maayos ang ating mga SUCs.

asr-000197
00:42:31.760 --> 00:42:34.560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At siyempre, ang ating pong Commission on Higher Education.

asr-000198
00:42:34.780 --> 00:42:40.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Be rest assured that we will do our part to try and fill in the gaps.

asr-000199
00:42:41.500 --> 00:42:43.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya lang, talagang hirap ngayon.

asr-000200
00:42:43.640 --> 00:42:46.900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pabigat, masikip, pero gagawan po natin ang paraan.

asr-000201
00:42:47.460 --> 00:42:48.460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: With that, I know.

asr-000202
00:42:48.660 --> 00:42:53.100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Of course, yield the floor to our subcommittee chair to lead today's proceedings.

asr-000203
00:42:53.300 --> 00:42:54.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Maraming salamat po.

asr-000204
00:42:54.380 --> 00:42:54.780
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you.

asr-000205
00:42:54.840 --> 00:42:56.440
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you so much, Mr. Chairman.

asr-000206
00:42:56.560 --> 00:43:02.260
Senator Joel Villanueva: And before you leave, let me again state for the record, their proposal, Mr. Chairman, sa CHED,

