asr-001201
01:36:19.540 --> 01:36:29.540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Makikita natin ano yung budget na kailangan natin moving forward, no? So, is that a target now of CHED yung acceptance rate, Chair Shirley?

