asr-001761
02:00:07.600 --> 02:00:12.500
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So that is the 38.46% admission rate, Mr. Chair.

asr-001762
02:00:12.940 --> 02:00:17.080
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So the message from this number is unmistakable, Mr. Chair.

asr-001763
02:00:17.560 --> 02:00:23.160
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Demand for public higher education is already exceeding the capacity of our institutions to respond.

asr-001764
02:00:23.160 --> 02:00:32.920
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: And I was very happy to listen to the conversation a while ago that to address this low admission rate, I think something must be done.

asr-001765
02:00:33.580 --> 02:00:43.600
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Deficiency must not be there because, you know, as in our illustration, 400 classrooms were not constructed because of the deficiency.

asr-001766
02:00:44.340 --> 02:00:50.080
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So that is, kung wala po sanang deficiency, baka na-expand ang ating capacity over the last four years.

asr-001767
02:00:50.080 --> 02:00:53.080
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Imagine the 12.3 billion, if that will be constructed.

asr-001768
02:00:53.160 --> 02:00:57.380
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: If that will be concentrated for classroom, there will be more classroom and it will provide for a wider access.

asr-001769
02:00:58.340 --> 02:01:08.920
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So in the next slide, we are thankful that our students will get more support because of the expanded 10931.

asr-001770
02:01:09.460 --> 02:01:11.340
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: We have now the 12325.

asr-001771
02:01:11.620 --> 02:01:22.520
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: We acknowledge that the government continues to face competing demands for limited fiscal space, including social protection, health, basic education, and other essential services.

asr-001772
02:01:22.520 --> 02:01:39.060
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: The challenge, however, is not to choose one vital public investment over the other, but to ensure that it receives adequate and sustainable funding commensurate with its mandate and the needs of its intended to address.

asr-001773
02:01:39.060 --> 02:01:50.380
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Now, Mr. Chair, what I am articulating is the expanded 10931. Republic Act 12325 provided expanded support for individual students.

asr-001774
02:01:50.380 --> 02:01:57.760
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: But I think we must prioritize the deficiency before we allocate additional benefits.

asr-001775
02:01:57.940 --> 02:01:58.660
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Why not address?

asr-001776
02:01:59.120 --> 02:02:04.480
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Why are we allowing a deficiency in the allocation for free higher education?

asr-001777
02:02:05.040 --> 02:02:09.480
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: In our app estimate, Mr. Chair, that is around 85% free.

asr-001778
02:02:09.780 --> 02:02:15.400
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: We are not paid around 15%, while that is not the very tenet of 10931.

asr-001779
02:02:15.400 --> 02:02:20.360
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So I think what we plea, what we appeal, let us give full.

asr-001780
02:02:20.380 --> 02:02:26.260
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Funding to Republic Act 10931 so that our SUCs will no longer suffer these deficiencies.

asr-001781
02:02:26.420 --> 02:02:35.140
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: This is, I may say, injustice to what we have promised them in terms of the full mandate of 10931.

asr-001782
02:02:37.920 --> 02:02:49.160
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Now, another plea, as earlier expressed, Mr. Chair, this is what we are really fighting for.

asr-001783
02:02:50.380 --> 02:02:59.000
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Section 54 of the Implementing Rules of Republic Act 10931 provides that the UniFAST Board must determine the composite fee.

asr-001784
02:02:59.400 --> 02:03:02.080
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Ito po yung tinalakay natin kanina with Senator Bam.

asr-001785
02:03:02.840 --> 02:03:04.700
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Now, or the normative composite fee.

asr-001786
02:03:04.840 --> 02:03:06.560
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Tapos na po si UniFAST.

asr-001787
02:03:07.120 --> 02:03:11.360
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: At in fact, yung sinasabi kayo ng SGV, that is the firm contracted by UniFAST.

asr-001788
02:03:11.680 --> 02:03:15.260
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: And based on the result, this is the formula considered.

asr-001789
02:03:15.700 --> 02:03:19.960
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: There were series of consultation among SUCs in different clusters.

asr-001790
02:03:19.960 --> 02:03:20.360
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Indicators.

asr-001791
02:03:20.380 --> 02:03:26.100
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: I think over the last year SGV proposed this normative formula.

asr-001792
02:03:26.580 --> 02:03:39.920
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: The normative budget is computed as the standard salaries and wages plus the student based operating costs plus non-faculty personal costs plus repair and maintenance.

asr-001793
02:03:40.400 --> 02:03:44.800
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: One beauty of this formula, this already includes miscellaneous fees, Mr. Chair.

asr-001794
02:03:44.800 --> 02:03:49.200
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: It's not only cost of student tuition fee.

asr-001795
02:03:50.380 --> 02:03:54.460
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: The initial result is around 1,212 pesos per unit.

asr-001796
02:03:55.360 --> 02:04:02.920
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: And that is, I think, the per capita figure being asked by Senator Bam, that is 31,844 per student.

asr-001797
02:04:03.380 --> 02:04:08.920
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: That on the average, opo, opo, opo, that includes already miscellaneous fees.

asr-001798
02:04:09.280 --> 02:04:20.140
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: And I think if we can start with this, I think we must be serious in implementing this specific provisions of 10.931.

asr-001799
02:04:20.380 --> 02:04:34.580
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Now, because of the required finance or budget for this, PASUC also proposed alternative upgrade of our tuition fee.

asr-001800
02:04:34.580 --> 02:04:42.760
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: As mentioned, as earlier articulated, there are SUCs collecting less than 100 peso, 50 peso, 12 peso.

asr-001801
02:04:42.880 --> 02:04:49.460
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: This is our proposal for SUCs whose tuition fees are 100 pesos and below.

asr-001802
02:04:49.660 --> 02:04:50.300
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: We propose.

asr-001803
02:04:50.380 --> 02:04:56.920
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: 100 or 200 peso increase per unit.

asr-001804
02:04:57.440 --> 02:05:09.640
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: And for SUCs whose tuition fee is from 100 pesos to 300 pesos, we are proposing 150 pesos per unit increase.

asr-001805
02:05:10.620 --> 02:05:18.000
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: There are, I think, there are 41 SUCs, Mr. Chair, among 113 collecting below 100 peso.

asr-001806
02:05:18.280 --> 02:05:19.700
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: And there are one.

asr-001807
02:05:19.700 --> 02:05:25.700
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: There are 70 SUCs collecting tuition fee from 101 to 300 peso per unit.

asr-001808
02:05:26.120 --> 02:05:28.940
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So for them, we propose an increase of 150 peso.

asr-001809
02:05:29.180 --> 02:05:36.040
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: If you note, there is a calibration of increase because those who are collecting lesser must be increased higher.

asr-001810
02:05:36.820 --> 02:05:44.680
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So if this proposal will be taken, we will be requesting 13.37 billion pesos.

asr-001811
02:05:44.680 --> 02:05:49.680
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: And for those SUCs collecting more than 300 to 500.

asr-001812
02:05:49.700 --> 02:05:53.160
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: There must be a cap, no more than 500 peso.

asr-001813
02:05:53.300 --> 02:05:57.960
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Meaning, if you are collecting 400 peso already, you will be increased only of 100 peso.

asr-001814
02:05:58.180 --> 02:06:00.340
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So this is calibrated increase, Mr. Chair.

asr-001815
02:06:01.160 --> 02:06:10.440
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: But if you are in that bracket, let's say, for example, you are collecting below 100 peso per unit, all of you will be increased by 200 peso per unit.

asr-001816
02:06:11.300 --> 02:06:16.520
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Now, I think this is more equitable in our view in PASUC.

asr-001817
02:06:16.520 --> 02:06:19.580
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: But I think this is a little different from.

asr-001818
02:06:19.580 --> 02:06:21.200
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: From what is presented by Ched a while ago.

asr-001819
02:06:21.920 --> 02:06:27.380
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: But since there is difference in the presentation, what we really push for is the SGV formula.

asr-001820
02:06:28.120 --> 02:06:29.280
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: We can agree.

asr-001821
02:06:29.460 --> 02:06:30.980
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: We can agree on the trans.

asr-001822
02:06:31.920 --> 02:06:35.580
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So medyo, this is just an alternative proposal.

asr-001823
02:06:36.300 --> 02:06:42.960
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: We agree with Ched that if we can talk with DBM and of course, Ched and SUCs, let's agree.

asr-001824
02:06:43.480 --> 02:06:47.720
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: But let's make it more scientific, more evidence-based.

asr-001825
02:06:47.720 --> 02:06:49.380
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Kasi itong amin pong ito, actually.

asr-001826
02:06:49.580 --> 02:06:59.880
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: This is just an assumption, a step gap, the one is just to make it equivalent or uniform, lahat 250.

asr-001827
02:06:59.880 --> 02:07:03.760
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Kung 250 ka na, ba't sumisingil ka ng 240, ang increase mo na lang 10 peso.

asr-001828
02:07:03.760 --> 02:07:05.760
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Ba't ang tanong, is that scientific?

asr-001829
02:07:05.760 --> 02:07:12.840
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So to avoid discussion on this, what we propose is the SGV formula, a calibrated SGV formula.

asr-001830
02:07:12.840 --> 02:07:17.120
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So that accounts to 13.37 billion, Mr. Chairman.

asr-001831
02:07:17.120 --> 02:07:18.120
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Next slide.

asr-001832
02:07:19.580 --> 02:07:26.340
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So I think, Mr. Chair, I would like to summarize our ask or our request, our plea.

asr-001833
02:07:26.840 --> 02:07:32.180
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: The very reason why the 113 SUCs came here today, because of the following.

asr-001834
02:07:34.200 --> 02:07:46.200
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: First is to settle the validated FHE deficiency for fiscal year 2025 and fiscal year 2026, estimated at around 5 billion pesos.

asr-001835
02:07:46.200 --> 02:07:49.560
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: That is our very first priority.

asr-001836
02:07:49.580 --> 02:08:02.920
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Second is to provide additional appropriation for capital outlay, especially for 25 SUCs without infrastructure allocation in the 2027 NEP.

asr-001837
02:08:04.200 --> 02:08:12.040
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: That is to expand our capacity and to increase, of course, the quality of our education in our SUCs.

asr-001838
02:08:12.040 --> 02:08:16.380
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Third, Mr. Chair, is to implement, seriously.

asr-001839
02:08:16.380 --> 02:08:17.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: the

asr-001840
02:08:17.740 --> 02:08:20.680
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: article or the section

asr-001841
02:08:20.680 --> 02:08:22.760
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: 54 of the implementing rules

asr-001842
02:08:22.760 --> 02:08:24.840
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: of the IRR or the IRR

asr-001843
02:08:24.840 --> 02:08:26.840
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: of the 10931, that is

asr-001844
02:08:26.840 --> 02:08:28.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: to implement the normative cost

asr-001845
02:08:28.740 --> 02:08:30.560
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: that is also our

asr-001846
02:08:30.560 --> 02:08:32.700
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: request. And fourth is

asr-001847
02:08:32.700 --> 02:08:34.800
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: the consistent use of projected

asr-001848
02:08:34.800 --> 02:08:36.600
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: enrollment as a primary

asr-001849
02:08:36.600 --> 02:08:38.840
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: basis for FHE. What do we mean, Mr. Chair,

asr-001850
02:08:38.900 --> 02:08:39.580
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: by that request?

asr-001851
02:08:41.580 --> 02:08:42.620
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Consistent use

asr-001852
02:08:42.620 --> 02:08:44.600
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: of the projected enrollment, that when

asr-001853
