asr-002046
02:15:59.340 --> 02:16:05.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: But this is one of the things I wanted to accomplish as part of my personal legacy here in the Senate.

asr-002047
02:16:06.360 --> 02:16:10.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I have been coordinating with EDCOM too and talking about it.

asr-002048
02:16:10.240 --> 02:16:15.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasi hindi naman pwede yung 12 pesos versus 500 pesos and you expect the same kind of education, quality education.

asr-002049
02:16:16.120 --> 02:16:22.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: Hindi naman po pwede din sa geographic location. Hindi rin po pwede na pagpareuhin mo yung parehong may supply ng guru.

asr-002050
02:16:23.680 --> 02:16:32.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ng teacher. Hindi rin po pwede mong pagparehuhin or pagsamahin na kulang yung laboratory equipment nung isang eskwelahat.

asr-002051
02:16:32.940 --> 02:16:37.020
Senator Joel Villanueva: Lalong hindi mo pwede i-compare yung trade disciplines.

asr-002052
02:16:37.020 --> 02:16:40.160
Senator Joel Villanueva: So talagang dapat mapag-aralan mo mabuti ito.

asr-002053
02:16:40.240 --> 02:16:46.780
