Senator Joel Villanueva: Yung UP. Kaya laging champion ng UP sa UAAP.

asr-002429
02:30:32.140 --> 02:30:44.140
Senator Joel Villanueva: But kidding aside, thank you, President Gigi, and congratulations dun sa tatlong bagong chancellor natin sa UPLB sa Manila and UP Visayas.

asr-002430
02:30:45.360 --> 02:30:45.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: Congratulations.

asr-002431
02:30:46.900 --> 02:30:58.540
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sir, may ano lang ako kasi when you were presenting kanina, dun sa resilient initiatives ng UP dito sa project,

asr-002432
02:30:58.560 --> 02:31:12.200
Senator Joel Villanueva: may we know if you're being consulted, for example, ang DPWH sa UP Urban Planning, naku-consult ho ba kayo?

asr-002433
02:31:12.300 --> 02:31:21.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: Nung isang araw ho, kasama namin yung, I think we were discussing the budget of DOST and I raised an issue with Pag-asa.

asr-002434
02:31:21.640 --> 02:31:27.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: And they were saying they can only, I don't want to...

asr-002435
02:31:28.560 --> 02:31:32.700
Senator Joel Villanueva: I want to make sure that I have the right exact words that they told me about.

asr-002436
02:31:33.300 --> 02:31:56.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: They can only predict, they can only forecast yung next three hours because there was a time na yung KAAP, yung KAAP po, ay nag-cancel ng flight two hours before the flight ng isang domestic flight going to Kawayan City

asr-002437
02:31:56.640 --> 02:31:57.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: on Wednesday.

asr-002438
02:31:58.560 --> 02:32:10.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: na yung mga kababayan ko sa Bulacan, bumiyahin ng alas dos, alas tres ng umaga, only to find out two hours before the flight na cancelled yung flight.

asr-002439
02:32:11.220 --> 02:32:12.100
Senator Joel Villanueva: That's a Wednesday.

asr-002440
02:32:12.800 --> 02:32:21.280
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thursday, bumiyahin ulit sila, the same day, the same flight, the same airline, and two hours again before the flight, sinabi, cancelled.

asr-002441
02:32:21.600 --> 02:32:28.280
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, you know, I'm thinking of, well, I have filed a bill here in the Senate for consumerism.

asr-002442
02:32:28.560 --> 02:32:42.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, you know, I have filed a bill here in the Senate for consumer protection, passenger protection bill, but I'm just curious kung kayo ba, nakakonsulto ba kayo ng mga government agencies natin?

asr-002443
02:32:42.140 --> 02:32:51.580
Senator Joel Villanueva: Because I would trust your programs more than, you know, for quite a long time, to be honest.

asr-002444
02:32:51.880 --> 02:32:56.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pag sinabi ng pag-asang malakas ang ulan, nakatirik yung araw.

asr-002445
02:32:56.480 --> 02:32:58.540
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, hindi ko mind.

asr-002446
02:32:58.560 --> 02:33:06.400
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pero, you know, ako personally, kasi binring up ko po ito sa floor, dito sa budget deliberation.

asr-002447
02:33:06.540 --> 02:33:26.200
Senator Joel Villanueva: I mean, how many times or how many of our kababayans would undergo this kind of suffering, terrible suffering na bumiyahin ka alas dos, alas tres ng umaga, mag-stay ka sa airport ng tatlo, apat na oras, only to find out na na-cancel yung flight, and then the next day, you do the same thing.

asr-002448
02:33:26.200 --> 02:33:27.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: Same exact thing.

asr-002449
02:33:27.640 --> 02:33:36.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, I'm just wondering, sir, no, and I hope kung kinukonsult kayo, bakit ganun? Kung hindi kayo kinukonsult, bakit kaya hindi?

asr-002450
02:33:36.620 --> 02:33:37.720
Senator Joel Villanueva: Anyway, sir, please, please.

asr-002451
02:33:37.780 --> 02:33:49.760
UP President Angelo A. Jimenez: Mr. Chair, I brought with me three of the most in-demand professors of the university, Dr. Gap for Medicine, Dr. Del Mundo for Power, and the person, the demand of the hour, Mr. Disaster, Dr. Mahar Lagmay.

asr-002452
02:33:51.180 --> 02:33:54.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: Please, Dr. Mahar Lagmay, of course.

asr-002453
02:33:54.640 --> 02:33:56.280
Senator Joel Villanueva: I think all of us know you, sir.

asr-002454
02:33:56.280 --> 02:33:56.700
Senator Joel Villanueva: Please.

asr-002455
02:33:56.980 --> 02:33:57.620
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: Ang tawag po.

asr-002456
02:33:57.640 --> 02:33:59.420
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: Sir, sa akin, lahar magmay.

asr-002457
02:34:02.380 --> 02:34:15.640
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: Anyway, yes, sir, nakukonsult po kami. In fact, for DPWH, even before nabigay sa amin yung aming SARO, January pa lang ay kinukonsultan na po kami ng DPWH.

asr-002458
02:34:16.520 --> 02:34:25.860
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: In fact, they have been giving us their designs for projects, thousands of them, na tinitignan namin kung okay o hindi.

asr-002459
02:34:25.860 --> 02:34:33.660
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: And tinitignan namin kung worth it yung ini-invest ng peso ng LGU or ng national government doon sa project.

asr-002460
02:34:34.540 --> 02:34:44.580
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: And this has happened only this year after there has been a lot of parang issues regarding the flood control.

asr-002461
02:34:46.440 --> 02:34:55.640
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: Masama din po ang Congress and Senate na may mga pinatitignan din sa amin na yung mga design kukunin din namin from DPWH.

asr-002462
02:34:55.860 --> 02:35:00.220
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: And then, tinitignan namin if it's worth it or not.

asr-002463
02:35:01.080 --> 02:35:18.180
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: Meron pong systematic na way to filter out yung mga okay o hindi. Parang scientific, methodical yung approach. Walang bias. Basta tinitignan namin ito yung methodology kung papasa o hindi.

asr-002464
02:35:18.180 --> 02:35:25.180
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sir, I know this is not the budget of DPWH. That's why I'm trying to get to another...

asr-002465
02:35:25.860 --> 02:35:37.460
Senator Joel Villanueva: I'm hearing today and just before I ask you some questions, yung project NOAA for example, yung pag-asa, yung ka-app, are you being consulted?

asr-002466
02:35:37.460 --> 02:35:52.460
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasi parang binigay sa akin na 3 hours daw talaga. Parang hindi ko matanggap eh. 3 hours talaga just for the airports and airline companies before they can actually cancel flights.

asr-002467
02:35:53.120 --> 02:35:55.840
Senator Joel Villanueva: Hindi ko lang talaga... I'm not a technical person.

asr-002468
02:35:55.860 --> 02:36:01.860
Senator Joel Villanueva: Just to find out, yun po ba talaga? Hindi talaga mapipredict na...

asr-002469
02:36:03.660 --> 02:36:10.100
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: Yung dati pong project NOAA, nakakapag-forecast po kami 4 hours in advance na 5 hours in advance.

asr-002470
02:36:10.100 --> 02:36:11.860
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasi nga kanina nakakita ko 24 hours.

asr-002471
02:36:12.040 --> 02:36:15.860
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: Tapos meron kaming impact-based forecasting system na...

asr-002472
02:36:15.860 --> 02:36:25.400
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, it adds salt to the wounds na ngayong araw pinaghintay ka, pinagbiyahi ka halos kalahating araw.

asr-002473
02:36:25.860 --> 02:36:27.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: Next, di gagawin ulit sa'yo.

asr-002474
02:36:28.140 --> 02:36:32.980
Senator Joel Villanueva: Parang saan yung katarungan doon? Parang lumusong pa ho sa bahayon.

asr-002475
02:36:33.100 --> 02:36:41.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: And you know, God knows, and in this particular room, how many times I raised the issue of flood control.

asr-002476
02:36:42.220 --> 02:36:46.180
Senator Joel Villanueva: How many times? Since 2020, the records will bail me out.

asr-002477
02:36:46.180 --> 02:36:50.440
Senator Joel Villanueva: Even the Bulacan flood control program, since time immemorial,

asr-002478
02:36:51.300 --> 02:36:55.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: inuupakan ko po yan, nandyan si President Chody ng Bulacan State University,

asr-002479
02:36:55.860 --> 02:37:02.040
Senator Joel Villanueva: hanggang ngayon, hanggang ngayon, hindi nila malaman kung anong gagawin.

asr-002480
02:37:02.040 --> 02:37:08.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I hope that you can help us with this program.

asr-002481
02:37:09.220 --> 02:37:19.460
Senator Joel Villanueva: You know, in so many years, since I became a member of Congress, I asked for an integrated flood control program.

asr-002482
02:37:19.640 --> 02:37:24.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: Wala po. And then, they were saying they needed a feasibility study.

asr-002483
02:37:24.660 --> 02:37:25.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: And during that time,

asr-002484
02:37:25.860 --> 02:37:28.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: they couldn't figure it out, what to do with it.

asr-002485
02:37:28.960 --> 02:37:30.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, walang funding.

asr-002486
02:37:30.900 --> 02:37:33.360
Senator Joel Villanueva: I was the one who funded the feasibility study.

asr-002487
02:37:33.640 --> 02:37:35.260
Senator Joel Villanueva: The year after, I followed it up.

asr-002488
02:37:35.600 --> 02:37:38.140
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sabi, hindi pa po tapos yung feasibility study.

asr-002489
02:37:38.220 --> 02:37:39.840
Senator Joel Villanueva: It's gonna take another year or so.

asr-002490
02:37:39.920 --> 02:37:41.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, two years, more than two years, I waited.

asr-002491
02:37:41.740 --> 02:37:48.140
Senator Joel Villanueva: When the feasibility study came out after two years, I asked again, after two years, hindi ini-implement.

asr-002492
02:37:48.600 --> 02:37:51.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: And then, few years later, I asked, why are you not implementing?

asr-002493
02:37:51.980 --> 02:37:52.760
Senator Joel Villanueva: Hindi na daw.

asr-002494
02:37:53.700 --> 02:37:55.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: Hindi na daw pwede yung feasibility study.

asr-002495
02:37:55.860 --> 02:37:56.380
Senator Joel Villanueva: Hindi na daw pwede yung feasibility study na yun.

asr-002496
02:37:56.480 --> 02:38:00.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: And then, came the flood control brouhaha.

asr-002497
02:38:01.220 --> 02:38:06.940
Senator Joel Villanueva: And God knows, until now, some people thought I have a case on this.

asr-002498
02:38:07.060 --> 02:38:08.400
Senator Joel Villanueva: Until now, wala ko akong case.

asr-002499
02:38:08.840 --> 02:38:10.140
Senator Joel Villanueva: May complaints, et cetera.

asr-002500
02:38:10.300 --> 02:38:11.980
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sinuturo na, kasama na ako ngayon.

asr-002501
02:38:13.200 --> 02:38:15.400
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I'm not scared to talk about this.

asr-002502
02:38:15.520 --> 02:38:18.120
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I'm always for justice.

asr-002503
02:38:18.120 --> 02:38:23.840
Senator Joel Villanueva: Until now, gusto ko nga, e-firing squad lahat ng may kaso dito.

asr-002504
02:38:24.500 --> 02:38:25.120
Senator Joel Villanueva: Talagang mapapatunayan.

asr-002505
02:38:25.860 --> 02:38:32.580
Senator Joel Villanueva: Talagang partin itong scheme na ito, itong kalokohan na kabulastugan na ito na nangyari.

asr-002506
02:38:32.720 --> 02:38:35.720
Senator Joel Villanueva: Dahil, number one, na-apektohan yung aming probinsya sa Bulanin.

asr-002507
02:38:35.720 --> 02:38:40.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: And until now, sir, ayokot ang tawagin ng lahar magmay.

asr-002508
02:38:41.060 --> 02:38:45.840
Senator Joel Villanueva: But, until now, problemado yung probinsya namin.

asr-002509
02:38:46.440 --> 02:38:47.620
Senator Joel Villanueva: I feel bad.

asr-002510
02:38:47.780 --> 02:38:54.460
Senator Joel Villanueva: And this is personal for me because one of the reasons why I ran for Senate.

asr-002511
02:38:54.460 --> 02:39:00.020
Senator Joel Villanueva: And dahil matagal, for 20 plus years, wala kaming representative from Bulacan dito sa Senado.

asr-002512
02:39:00.480 --> 02:39:02.040
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ay dyan, exactly for that.

asr-002513
02:39:02.180 --> 02:39:03.460
Senator Joel Villanueva: For flood control programs.

asr-002514
02:39:04.100 --> 02:39:05.100
Senator Joel Villanueva: And until now, wala po.

asr-002515
02:39:05.640 --> 02:39:07.020
Senator Joel Villanueva: That's what I'm gonna do right now.

asr-002516
02:39:07.120 --> 02:39:08.140
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasi wala na naman yan.

asr-002517
02:39:08.680 --> 02:39:09.980
Senator Joel Villanueva: Hindi na naman integrated dyan.

asr-002518
02:39:10.100 --> 02:39:13.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pag nagawa yung sa isang barangay, sa kabilang barangay, lilipat.

asr-002519
02:39:13.440 --> 02:39:16.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pag nagawa yung isang buong town, sa kabilang town, lilipat.

asr-002520
02:39:17.020 --> 02:39:22.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: And then, if probably we'll be able to address the problem of flooding in Bulacan,

asr-002521
02:39:22.220 --> 02:39:24.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: baka sa Pampanga lumipat o sa ibang...

asr-002522
02:39:24.460 --> 02:39:28.540
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, you know, I know this is not the budget of DPWH.

asr-002523
02:39:28.900 --> 02:39:31.200
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sir, siguro, I will just...

asr-002524
02:39:31.200 --> 02:39:35.140
Senator Joel Villanueva: I don't wanna waste everyone's time here, but I will coordinate with you.

asr-002525
02:39:35.340 --> 02:39:38.380
Senator Joel Villanueva: And hopefully po, ang pakiusap ko po,

asr-002526
02:39:38.440 --> 02:39:42.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: ma-check niyo yung program ng flood control for Bulacan, please, especially.

asr-002527
02:39:43.420 --> 02:39:45.000
Senator Joel Villanueva: It's very personal to me, sir.

asr-002528
02:39:45.580 --> 02:39:46.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you. Please, please.

asr-002529
02:39:47.080 --> 02:39:50.460
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: Yung tanong niyo po, sir, yung kung pwedeng mag-forecast, no?

asr-002530
02:39:50.680 --> 02:39:51.940
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: It was in the presentation.

asr-002531
02:39:51.940 --> 02:39:54.420
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: We have an impact-based forecast.

asr-002532
02:39:54.460 --> 02:39:57.400
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: It's a testing system that has worked, no?

asr-002533
02:39:57.480 --> 02:40:02.160
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: It has won the Innovation Award, awarded by USAID and the World Food Program.

asr-002534
02:40:02.540 --> 02:40:04.680
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: It has been around since two years ago.

asr-002535
02:40:05.420 --> 02:40:08.740
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: And it was able to predict, tino, hindi lang natin ginamit.

asr-002536
02:40:09.220 --> 02:40:10.060
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: But since then...

asr-002537
02:40:10.060 --> 02:40:11.200
Senator Joel Villanueva: Why can't we not using it, sir?

asr-002538
02:40:11.420 --> 02:40:12.480
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: Sir, I don't know.

asr-002539
02:40:12.680 --> 02:40:15.020
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: But DepEd used it, no?

asr-002540
02:40:15.380 --> 02:40:17.760
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: DepEd used it nung dumating yung basyang.

asr-002541
02:40:18.280 --> 02:40:23.700
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: You can ask DepEd na meron silang forecast warning one day in advance.

asr-002542
02:40:23.700 --> 02:40:30.380
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: And they were able to prepare, minimal yung kanilang damages because they were able to respond.

asr-002543
02:40:30.580 --> 02:40:32.380
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ka-up, sir? Are you being consulted?

asr-002544
02:40:32.660 --> 02:40:33.200
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: Hindi, sir.

asr-002545
02:40:33.520 --> 02:40:34.160
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: Hindi, sir.

asr-002546
02:40:34.260 --> 02:40:42.960
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: Although we work with them kasi bibigay sila ng license sa amin for us to train ng mga pilots for drone LIDARs,

asr-002547
02:40:43.040 --> 02:40:45.180
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: which we will use for flood mapping,

asr-002548
02:40:45.660 --> 02:40:52.700
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: and which we will distribute to the SUCs para mag-capacitate and co-create knowledge for the flood model.

asr-002549
02:40:52.700 --> 02:40:53.300
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: The flood model.

asr-002550
02:40:53.700 --> 02:40:56.180
Senator Joel Villanueva: May ignorance on this particular topic dun sa...

asr-002551
02:40:56.180 --> 02:40:59.400
Senator Joel Villanueva: I know this is not part of our discussion.

asr-002552
02:40:59.400 --> 02:41:09.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pero yung pag-forecast ng allowing the airplanes to depart or to arrive from the airport,

asr-002553
02:41:10.380 --> 02:41:12.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: hindi naman siguro three hours before lang.

asr-002554
02:41:13.160 --> 02:41:18.140
Senator Joel Villanueva: Yun lang ba talaga yung most that we can do to cancel flights?

asr-002555
02:41:18.280 --> 02:41:20.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: Just to cancel flights.

asr-002556
02:41:20.920 --> 02:41:22.600
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasi talagang laging, for example,

asr-002557
02:41:22.600 --> 02:41:23.600
Senator Joel Villanueva: ang mga...

asr-002558
02:41:23.700 --> 02:41:25.480
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pal, Cebu Park, et cetera,

asr-002559
02:41:25.820 --> 02:41:27.160
Senator Joel Villanueva: ayaw mag-cancel ng flights yan.

asr-002560
02:41:27.280 --> 02:41:29.120
Senator Joel Villanueva: Talagang hanggang, hanggat maaari,

asr-002561
02:41:29.480 --> 02:41:32.540
Senator Joel Villanueva: i-risk lahat ng sasakay ng aeroplano.

asr-002562
02:41:32.700 --> 02:41:35.400
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pero ang problema, yung mga tao na naghihintay,

asr-002563
02:41:36.060 --> 02:41:37.400
Senator Joel Villanueva: hindi naman makatarungan.

asr-002564
02:41:38.340 --> 02:41:40.620
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: Baka, sir, magandang may system, no?

asr-002565
02:41:41.580 --> 02:41:46.060
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: Kasi as you get nearer to the time na kailangan naman mag-decide,

asr-002566
02:41:46.460 --> 02:41:48.560
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: mas gumaganda lang gumaganda yung forecast.

asr-002567
02:41:49.040 --> 02:41:52.040
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: So baka pwedeng may system na gawin.

asr-002568
02:41:52.040 --> 02:41:52.860
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: But, of course,

asr-002569
02:41:53.700 --> 02:41:54.880
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: ikaw ba araw pang gagawa?

asr-002570
02:41:54.880 --> 02:41:56.360
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: We're the university.

asr-002571
02:41:56.400 --> 02:41:58.760
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: So, ang official noon talagang pag-asa.

asr-002572
02:41:58.800 --> 02:42:00.680
UP Resilience Institute Executive Director Alfredo Mahar Francisco A. Lagmay: Maybe we can make suggestions.

asr-002573
02:42:00.700 --> 02:42:01.560
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you, sir.

asr-002574
02:42:01.560 --> 02:42:03.840
Senator Joel Villanueva: Just to make sure na pwede.

asr-002575
02:42:03.840 --> 02:42:06.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: Anyway, sa UPPGH, nandito din lang si Doc Gap.

asr-002576
02:42:07.840 --> 02:42:12.800
Senator Joel Villanueva: I-take ko na yung opportunity na maitanong itong Hospital Services Program, Doc.

asr-002577
02:42:12.820 --> 02:42:17.900
Senator Joel Villanueva: Yung proposed budget is 7.291 billion,

asr-002578
02:42:17.920 --> 02:42:20.900
Senator Joel Villanueva: which is...

asr-002579
02:42:20.920 --> 02:42:21.800
Senator Joel Villanueva: Di ko na makikita.

asr-002580
02:42:21.820 --> 02:42:22.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: Doc Gap.

asr-002581
02:42:22.820 --> 02:42:23.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: Malabo na rin matako.

asr-002582
02:42:25.740 --> 02:42:32.720
Senator Joel Villanueva: 805.457 million or 9.9% lower than its 2026 level.

asr-002583
02:42:32.720 --> 02:42:43.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: Gusto ko lang mong malaman, Dok, yung PGH actual funding requirement to maintain its present level of hospital services,

asr-002584
02:42:43.520 --> 02:42:47.100
Senator Joel Villanueva: particularly for indigent and financially vulnerable patients.

asr-002585
02:42:47.440 --> 02:42:50.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: Malaki ba ang epekto nito? Ano bang mangyayari po sa atin dito?

asr-002586
02:42:50.820 --> 02:43:11.000
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Ito pong more than 800 million deficit from our 2026 GAA and the proposed budget for 2027 in the NEP will involve 602 million pesos for medical assistance to patients or mga medical supplies.

asr-002587
02:43:11.900 --> 02:43:16.580
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Tumaas po kasing tubig at kuryente so makukulang po ng 104 million.

asr-002588
02:43:17.320 --> 02:43:19.920
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Our monthly electricity now.

asr-002589
02:43:20.820 --> 02:43:31.660
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Mr. Chair is 22 million because of the increase in the actual rate and the increase in the number of equipment that PGH has to serve its patients.

asr-002590
02:43:31.660 --> 02:43:44.020
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: And because these machines, this equipment require very sensitive maintenance and repairs, we will need additional 190 million to make them run efficiently for our patients.

asr-002591
02:43:44.580 --> 02:43:49.840
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: So as far as patient services is concerned, this is a combination of these three areas.

asr-002592
02:43:50.820 --> 02:43:57.140
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: If not properly funded, will really affect the way we serve our patients.

asr-002593
02:43:57.300 --> 02:44:09.880
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Of course, we're also asking for additional capital outlay to ensure that the goal to improve the accommodations of our patients and increase beds is also achieved.

asr-002594
02:44:09.880 --> 02:44:19.700
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you. Before I continue, let me acknowledge our very hardworking Senate President who will also help CHED and SUCs.

asr-002595
02:44:20.820 --> 02:44:22.720
Senator Joel Villanueva: So get back the request.

asr-002596
02:44:23.120 --> 02:44:30.040
Senator Joel Villanueva: Senator Sherwin Gatchelian, our Senate President, also a champion for education in this institution.

asr-002597
02:44:30.380 --> 02:44:31.760
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you, sir, for joining us.

asr-002598
02:44:35.260 --> 02:44:39.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: Doc Gap, para lang madali, para mas mabilis po tayo.

asr-002599
02:44:39.800 --> 02:44:46.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: 602 million ang maapektuhan ng mga medical supplies, medical services, and then 190.

asr-002600
02:44:47.220 --> 02:44:49.400
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pwede po bang paki-ano na lang po sa amin?

asr-002601
02:44:49.400 --> 02:44:50.400
Senator Joel Villanueva: May listahan?

asr-002602
02:44:50.820 --> 02:44:52.960
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Sana po kami sasubmit namin po.

asr-002603
02:44:52.960 --> 02:45:00.000
Senator Joel Villanueva: Oo, please. Parang yan common sense po eh. Hindi ko alam bakit tinanggal po.

asr-002604
02:45:00.000 --> 02:45:06.160
Senator Joel Villanueva: And alam nyo naman, Dokgap, tayo, nagkakaintindihan tayo sa mga pangailangan ng PGH.

asr-002605
02:45:06.660 --> 02:45:11.860
Senator Joel Villanueva: Hindi ko na iisa-isahin yung mga ginawa natin but I'm a big fan of PGH.

asr-002606
02:45:12.300 --> 02:45:19.260
Senator Joel Villanueva: I'm a big fan of our doctors in PGH. Pinagmamalaki ko kahit sa ang lupalop ng daigdig.

asr-002607
02:45:20.520 --> 02:45:26.320
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sigoy, kunin na lang namin yung listahan para matulungan po namin yung PGH.

asr-002608
02:45:26.380 --> 02:45:27.420
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Yes, Mr. Chair. Thank you.

asr-002609
02:45:27.420 --> 02:45:28.540
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you.

asr-002610
02:45:31.540 --> 02:45:41.560
Senator Joel Villanueva: Let me try to start asking questions dun sa CHED budget.

asr-002611
02:45:41.560 --> 02:45:56.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: Siguro, again, help me help the SUCs, the Commission so that we'll be able to present

asr-002612
02:45:56.820 --> 02:45:57.400
Senator Joel Villanueva: a

asr-002613
02:45:57.420 --> 02:46:01.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: compelling case here that we did need funding.

asr-002614
02:46:02.700 --> 02:46:06.380
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kanina, tinignan kong maigi yung utilization rate.

asr-002615
02:46:06.380 --> 02:46:13.580
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kanina, tinignan kong maigi itong obligation rate.

asr-002616
02:46:13.940 --> 02:46:16.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: 2025, 86.5%.

asr-002617
02:46:16.340 --> 02:46:19.520
Senator Joel Villanueva: 2026, 44.9%.

asr-002618
02:46:19.520 --> 02:46:26.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: Yung disbursement rate ng 2025, 63.7%.

asr-002619
02:46:26.820 --> 02:46:38.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: Yung 2026, 21.181 billion in release allotments remained unobligated.

asr-002620
02:46:38.700 --> 02:46:44.120
Senator Joel Villanueva: And 16.185 billion in appropriations remained unreleased.

asr-002621
02:46:44.760 --> 02:46:45.860
Senator Joel Villanueva: Is that the correct figure?

asr-002622
02:46:45.960 --> 02:46:51.540
Senator Joel Villanueva: Just to make sure that I have the same figures para alam po natin.

asr-002623
02:46:51.540 --> 02:46:56.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: Because that's one thing, ma'am, for sure na some of our colleagues will ask.

asr-002624
02:46:56.820 --> 02:47:41.300
Senator Joel Villanueva: If we are, with regards to budget performance and institutional capacity, siguro important na makapagbigay tayo ng ranking, showing legal basis natin, requested amount, unique beneficiaries, utilization, and implementation readiness natin, ma'am, para mabigyan n'yo kami ng ammunition para ma-present po namin ito sa aming mga kasamahan dito sa Senado before we can finalize our committee report. Thank you. Ma'am, please. Sige po.

asr-002629
02:47:41.700 --> 02:47:44.080
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Thank you very much, Chair.

asr-002630
02:47:44.080 --> 02:47:55.860
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: For the comparative budget utilization from 2024 and 2025, I would like to highlight here that the 2025,

asr-002631
02:47:55.860 --> 02:48:16.680
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: which we are terminating by 2026, these are continuing, these are continuing, to 2025 po, these are continuing to 2026, which should be fully liquidated at the end of 2026.

asr-002632
02:48:16.680 --> 02:48:24.220
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Tama po kayo na ang aming obligation is 97.9% na po.

asr-002633
02:48:24.640 --> 02:48:25.680
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Pero ang disbursement,

asr-002634
02:48:25.860 --> 02:48:29.500
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: is only 83.7%.

asr-002635
02:48:29.500 --> 02:48:42.100
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Now, all papers are ready, but we are waiting for the September na po kasi dumating ang pera release.

asr-002636
02:48:42.620 --> 02:48:50.780
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So, for 2026, let me highlight first na para naman may konting plus point kami.

asr-002637
02:48:50.780 --> 02:48:55.780
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Ang DUR mid-year 2025.

asr-002638
02:48:55.860 --> 02:48:58.400
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: That was before us, was 35%.

asr-002639
02:48:58.400 --> 02:49:02.000
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: The same date as of June 30, 2026.

asr-002640
02:49:02.900 --> 02:49:12.200
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: There is now as the same period, this 2026, there is an increase of 5.28%.

asr-002641
02:49:12.200 --> 02:49:12.860
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Okay.

asr-002642
02:49:12.860 --> 02:49:25.860
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: If we go to the table now, to the actual consolidated status of budget utilization namin, as of June 30, 2026, our obligation is 40.20%.

asr-002643
02:49:25.860 --> 02:49:32.500
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: This is because our funding operates on a school year basis.

asr-002644
02:49:32.500 --> 02:49:39.200
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And the first semester starts August 2026.

asr-002645
02:49:40.340 --> 02:49:54.500
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Comparing the obligation versus disbursement, only 51.18% of the 40% obligation, it is because of the cash availability.

asr-002646
02:49:54.500 --> 02:49:54.860
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Okay.

asr-002647
02:49:54.860 --> 02:50:01.900
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, if we go to the table now, to the actual consolidated status of budget utilization, only 51.18% of the 40% obligation, it is because of the cash availability.

asr-002648
02:50:01.900 --> 02:50:09.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ma'am, okay na okay po ako, hindi niyo okay lang ang pag-depensa niyan dahil naniniwala po.

asr-002649
02:50:09.340 --> 02:50:13.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, just give us yung ammunition, yung documents about this, para makatulong po.

asr-002650
02:50:13.340 --> 02:50:15.340
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yes, we will submit.

asr-002651
02:50:15.340 --> 02:50:19.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: Let me, before I continue, let me give the floor to our Senate President.

asr-002652
02:50:19.340 --> 02:50:21.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: Palakpa ka naman dyan para malaki tulong sa atin.

asr-002653
02:50:21.340 --> 02:50:23.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you.

asr-002654
02:50:23.340 --> 02:50:25.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sir Senate President, you have the floor.

asr-002655
02:50:25.340 --> 02:50:27.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you.

asr-002656
02:50:27.340 --> 02:50:31.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you at linalagay mo ako sa hot seat, Mr. Chairman.

asr-002657
02:50:31.340 --> 02:50:37.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Maraming salamat po at I'm just reviewing some of the items in the budget.

asr-002658
02:50:37.340 --> 02:50:49.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But I'll start with itong increase sa PGH, UP PGH last year, kay Doc Legaspi.

asr-002659
02:50:49.340 --> 02:50:51.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Last year, nagdagdag ang Senate ng 1.8 billion.

asr-002661
02:50:53.340 --> 02:50:55.340
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Yes.

asr-002662
02:50:55.340 --> 02:51:01.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And remember, you gave us a wish list, although hindi natin na-finance lahat.

asr-002663
02:51:01.340 --> 02:51:09.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But I just want to get an update dito sa 1.8 billion na augment ng Senado para sa PGH,

asr-002664
02:51:09.340 --> 02:51:17.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: considering that mahalaga ang papel ng PGH because of research and also because of its hospital operations.

asr-002665
02:51:17.340 --> 02:51:27.900
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: So itong 1.8 billion ay karagdagang pondo para sa drugs and medicine supplies, yung MOOE po na 1.04 billion.

asr-002667
02:51:27.900 --> 02:51:47.600
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: At yung pong ating bagong mandato na zero balance billing na 800 million, at saka 15 million po for our project for a very unique Filipino disease called X-linked dystonia Parkinsonism, or Lubag of Panay.

asr-002668
02:51:47.600 --> 02:51:50.340
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Ayun po.

asr-002669
02:51:50.340 --> 02:51:56.580
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: kakatanggap lang po namin ng pondo through the PISARO.

asr-002670
02:51:57.580 --> 02:51:59.520
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: So we just received it I think a month ago.

asr-002671
02:52:00.960 --> 02:52:04.800
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: But so far this morning of the 800 million po,

asr-002672
02:52:05.480 --> 02:52:10.840
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: ang aming na-obligate ay almost 500 million, more than 500 million na po.

asr-002673
02:52:10.840 --> 02:52:17.800
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Ang na-obligate at na-liquidate for the 800 million zero balance billing.

asr-002674
02:52:17.800 --> 02:52:23.960
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Ganun po karami yung utang namin sa mga suppliers for the year that passed.

asr-002675
02:52:24.400 --> 02:52:27.820
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Yung 1 billion naman po, na-ano na po,

asr-002676
02:52:29.040 --> 02:52:34.380
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: nabangga na po namin sa aming annual procurement plan.

asr-002677
02:52:34.380 --> 02:52:40.060
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: And it should be obligating and disbursing soon, this 1 billion pesos po.

asr-002678
02:52:42.560 --> 02:52:46.960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Itong in-augment natin primarily went to MOE.

asr-002679
02:52:46.960 --> 02:52:51.060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And also zero balance billing.

asr-002680
02:52:51.240 --> 02:52:52.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Which is MOE rin yun?

asr-002681
02:52:53.000 --> 02:52:59.420
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Hindi po. So ang zero balance billing po ay to pay for services.

asr-002682
02:52:59.660 --> 02:53:01.720
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Ang MOE po kailangan namin i-bid.

asr-002683
02:53:01.980 --> 02:53:07.080
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Kunwari may gamot, bibili kami ng medication, ng drugs, chemicals, reagents,

asr-002684
02:53:07.160 --> 02:53:11.120
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: or the other supplies needed for patients.

asr-002685
02:53:11.320 --> 02:53:14.220
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Yung zero balance billing po is paying for the service.

asr-002686
02:53:14.220 --> 02:53:16.820
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Kunwari po ay pinasiti-scan or MRI.

asr-002687
02:53:16.960 --> 02:53:17.960
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Or PET-CT scan.

asr-002688
02:53:18.540 --> 02:53:21.300
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Or may ginawa pong operasyon or procedure.

asr-002689
02:53:22.060 --> 02:53:25.620
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Yung service po na ito, ito yung babayaran ng zero balance billing.

asr-002690
02:53:27.360 --> 02:53:30.020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Nasa MOE rin siya, diba? Yung zero balance billing?

asr-002691
02:53:30.020 --> 02:53:33.920
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Nandun rin po siya, pero may special po siyang kategorya.

asr-002692
02:53:33.920 --> 02:53:39.120
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Para hindi po siya kailangan i-bid out for drugs, medicines, and supplies.

asr-002693
02:53:39.860 --> 02:53:46.020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And gusto ko lang malaman, Dok, itong zero balance billing is we want to...

asr-002694
02:53:46.960 --> 02:54:01.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ...increase or at least maintain for 2027 for the entire DOH, lahat ng DOH hospitals, including yung mga specialty hospitals.

asr-002695
02:54:01.880 --> 02:54:10.540
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So in your case, sa PGH, itong zero balance billing na idinagdag ng Senate, is this enough or is it kulang?

asr-002696
02:54:10.540 --> 02:54:13.840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Or ano bang experience ng PGH?

asr-002697
02:54:14.840 --> 02:54:16.780
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Katulad po ng sinabi ko nung kanina.

asr-002698
02:54:16.960 --> 02:54:25.180
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: May kulang pa po ng konti for 2027, 600 million, para lang po mapantayan yung aming nagagawa in 2026.

asr-002699
02:54:25.960 --> 02:54:41.000
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: So tama lang po itong, kung mabalik lang po yung aming 800 million na shortfall for our submitted post-budget for 2027 billion,

asr-002700
02:54:41.000 --> 02:54:45.360
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: we will be able to carry out the zero balance billing program for 2027.

asr-002701
02:54:45.560 --> 02:54:46.720
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But how much, Dok?

asr-002702
02:54:46.960 --> 02:54:49.620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: For the zero balance billing.

asr-002703
02:54:49.960 --> 02:54:51.860
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: It's around 2 billion pesos a year po.

asr-002704
02:54:52.080 --> 02:54:53.640
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: 2 billion pesos a year.

asr-002705
02:54:53.660 --> 02:54:55.720
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And then of which, ang nabigay?

asr-002706
02:54:56.560 --> 02:54:59.060
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Last year po, nabigyan ng 1.3 billion.

asr-002707
02:54:59.180 --> 02:55:00.780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: 1.3, so may balance sa 700.

asr-002708
02:55:00.780 --> 02:55:01.400
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Opo.

asr-002709
02:55:02.540 --> 02:55:13.300
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Pagka po lang kukulang, ginagamit ng hospital ang income or savings para po tuloy-tuloy na mabigay ang servisyo sa zero balance billing.

asr-002710
02:55:13.300 --> 02:55:13.400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Opo.

asr-002711
02:55:13.400 --> 02:55:15.080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi yun ang...

asr-002712
02:55:15.080 --> 02:55:16.780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Of course, yun ang ating...

asr-002713
02:55:16.960 --> 02:55:20.620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: battle cry right now, yung zero balance billing.

asr-002714
02:55:21.000 --> 02:55:25.540
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So yung mga constituents natin na pumupunta sa public hospitals,

asr-002715
02:55:26.260 --> 02:55:28.200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: regardless of your income,

asr-002716
02:55:28.920 --> 02:55:32.260
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: you can avail of the zero balance billing.

asr-002717
02:55:32.600 --> 02:55:36.620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So yun yung we're trying to protect that for 2027.

asr-002718
02:55:37.060 --> 02:55:39.660
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: If I may explain, Mr. Chair,

asr-002719
02:55:39.660 --> 02:55:45.240
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: ang zero balance billing po ngayon ay 100% sa ating mga indigent patients.

asr-002720
02:55:46.080 --> 02:55:46.760
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: So,

asr-002721
02:55:46.960 --> 02:56:00.600
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: meron po kaming meeting ng PhilHealth at ng DOH na paano pag-aralan na iaakyat po ito sa mga lower middle income patients or even the middle income patients which actually expands universal health care coverage.

asr-002722
02:56:00.600 --> 02:56:04.500
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: So, meron pong mga programa tulad ng EMA-EFIP.

asr-002723
02:56:05.000 --> 02:56:12.000
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Pagka dinagdag po natin sa current funding ng PhilHealth, ng income ng hospital, ng savings,

asr-002724
02:56:12.840 --> 02:56:16.800
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: we can now see a path towards expanding zero balance.

asr-002725
02:56:16.960 --> 02:56:41.500
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Billing to those already in the pay wards, hindi naman sa pay single room pero nasa ward po, and hopefully mga teachers ang maliit lang ang sweldo o ating mga government workers ang maliit lang ang sweldo pero nasa pay floors, nasa pay wards, mako-cover na lang po hopefully ng zero balance billing or at least konti na lang ang kanilang ilalabas. So yun po yung pinag-aaralan ngayon.

asr-002726
02:56:41.800 --> 02:56:44.200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I think that's also,

asr-002727
02:56:44.200 --> 02:56:46.240
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Right now, kasi kung nasa pay ward ka,

asr-002728
02:56:46.240 --> 02:56:48.000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ang pumapasok is yung

asr-002729
02:56:48.000 --> 02:56:49.200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: MAIP.

asr-002731
02:56:49.300 --> 02:56:51.800
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yung MAIP.

asr-002732
02:56:51.800 --> 02:56:55.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yung medical assistance, MAIP, yun ang pumapasok.

asr-002733
02:56:55.960 --> 02:57:01.880
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But if you're outside of the pay ward, dito na pumapasok si zero balance billing.

asr-002734
02:57:02.440 --> 02:57:02.640
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Correct.

asr-002735
02:57:03.380 --> 02:57:14.240
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Pero kung kayo po, kahit may kaya kayo, ang prinsipi ng zero balance billing, kahit may kaya kayo at kayo humiga sa isang charity bed, zero pa rin ho kayo.

asr-002736
02:57:14.240 --> 02:57:14.700
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Correct.

asr-002737
02:57:14.700 --> 02:57:26.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That's where we are balancing kasi since uncovered lang naman ng zero balance ay yung charity ward or the pay ward.

asr-002738
02:57:27.740 --> 02:57:33.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Marami kasing cases sa mga government hospitals dahil sobrang puno.

asr-002739
02:57:33.560 --> 02:57:41.780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang occupancy rate ng government hospital naglalaro anything between 130% to almost 200% in some cases.

asr-002740
02:57:42.700 --> 02:57:44.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Nafaforce sila, napapwere sa sila.

asr-002741
02:57:44.700 --> 02:57:47.060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Sa pay wards.

asr-002742
02:57:47.260 --> 02:57:47.540
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Opo.

asr-002743
02:57:47.900 --> 02:57:53.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pag na-forsa sila sa pay wards, hindi naman sila maka-avail ng zero balance billing.

asr-002744
02:57:53.540 --> 02:57:58.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So doon na pumapasok yung medical assistance or MAIP.

asr-002745
02:57:59.360 --> 02:58:11.700
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Yung bagong MAIP, yung bagong programa, ito po ay as end users, mas madali po namin nagagamit ito kasi po ang approving authority lang ay yung medical center chief.

asr-002746
02:58:12.220 --> 02:58:14.700
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: So mas na-review.

asr-002747
02:58:14.700 --> 02:58:23.240
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Para-rationalize po namin ang paggamit ng e-MAIP with the actual need, with the actual financial burden of the patient.

asr-002748
02:58:23.460 --> 02:58:32.080
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Dahil nga social worker based pa rin yung pag-allot ng assistance sa mga private patient na alanganin naman pong magbayad din.

asr-002749
02:58:32.540 --> 02:58:43.400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Well, binabalansi po namin dito nila Senator Joel yung MAIP, yung zero balance billing as well as yung PhilHealth subsidies.

asr-002750
02:58:43.400 --> 02:58:44.580
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So all of this.

asr-002751
02:58:44.700 --> 02:58:47.860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi dumadating dito so we're balancing that eh no?

asr-002752
02:58:48.040 --> 02:58:48.680
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Opo, yeah.

asr-002753
02:58:49.420 --> 02:59:03.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: I think Mr. Senate President, what mentioned a while ago by Dr. Gap, yung maapektuhan at least yung 600 million worth of medical supplies for our indigent patients.

asr-002754
02:59:03.600 --> 02:59:03.720
Senator Joel Villanueva: Di ba?

asr-002755
02:59:04.000 --> 02:59:10.260
Senator Joel Villanueva: Because of the slashing of this 9.9% decrease in the budget of PGH.

asr-002756
02:59:10.840 --> 02:59:11.940
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you.

asr-002757
02:59:11.940 --> 02:59:14.280
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you for that, Mr. Chairman.

asr-002758
02:59:14.700 --> 02:59:18.580
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I'll jump to another question to Ched.

asr-002759
02:59:19.220 --> 02:59:26.060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And this is in relation to yung free higher education deficiencies.

asr-002760
02:59:27.500 --> 02:59:31.080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Na-fully settle na ba ito, Chairperson Shirley?

asr-002761
02:59:31.940 --> 02:59:38.600
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Last year kasi naglagay tayong ng 4.4 billion pesos.

asr-002762
02:59:38.600 --> 02:59:44.600
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And then Ched naglagay ng 7.8 billion.

asr-002763
02:59:44.700 --> 02:59:56.060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And moving forward, the formula na gagamitin ng SUCs are based on projections rather than actual.

asr-002764
02:59:56.560 --> 02:59:59.920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yung actual kasi creates a deficiency.

asr-002765
03:00:00.000 --> 03:00:18.300
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, two questions. Nabayaran na ba itong 12.3 billion na deficiency? And then, the next question is, are we already enforcing the new formula? Therefore, hindi na ho tayo magkakaroon ng deficiencies.

asr-002766
03:00:18.300 --> 03:00:48.280
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Thank you very much, sir.

asr-002767
03:00:48.300 --> 03:01:00.480
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: May check eh. Itong mga 20 ay may konting deficiency pa. So, if they can submit it next week, then we will finish the disbursement immediately.

asr-002768
03:01:02.260 --> 03:01:04.020
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: For the second question.

asr-002769
03:01:05.020 --> 03:01:09.580
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ma'am, first question lang is, so in other words, it's being processed now?

asr-002770
03:01:09.660 --> 03:01:11.100
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yes po, it is being processed.

asr-002771
03:01:11.100 --> 03:01:18.280
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And then, eventually we will settle all the 12.3 billion.

asr-002772
03:01:18.300 --> 03:01:21.220
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: 9.7 billion pesos deficiency. Masasettle na natin yan.

asr-002773
03:01:21.420 --> 03:01:41.600
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: As of the recalculation po, 9.7 billion ang nirelease sa amin because we align our data, DBM, CHED, and based on the PASUC submission, nag-total lang po siya ng 9.7 billion pesos.

asr-002774
03:01:43.600 --> 03:01:45.960
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: For the second question.

asr-002775
03:01:45.960 --> 03:01:47.960
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yan po yung pinagkakaroon.

asr-002776
03:01:48.300 --> 03:01:53.440
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Napakiusap namin ngayon. Tapos na po yung SGV report namin.

asr-002777
03:01:54.000 --> 03:01:57.420
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Nila, UNIFAS board already accepted it.

asr-002778
03:01:57.800 --> 03:01:59.120
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: We already have the data.

asr-002779
03:01:59.940 --> 03:02:05.460
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: They calculated the cost of education per students per year.

asr-002780
03:02:06.300 --> 03:02:13.600
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And we tried to spread that into four tranches.

asr-002781
03:02:13.600 --> 03:02:16.100
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Kung i-implement na, ready for implement.

asr-002782
03:02:16.260 --> 03:02:17.600
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: The question is fund.

asr-002783
03:02:18.300 --> 03:02:18.980
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Availability.

asr-002784
03:02:19.960 --> 03:02:22.120
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So, medyo malaki po ang kailangan.

asr-002785
03:02:22.560 --> 03:02:28.080
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: We can submit to you the cost requirement, the fund requirement per tranche.

asr-002786
03:02:28.540 --> 03:02:35.980
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Kasi ang nakikita namin is if we expand into four tranches, that means four years, malaki po ang kailangan.

asr-002787
03:02:36.420 --> 03:02:37.720
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: We can submit it to you.

asr-002788
03:02:37.780 --> 03:02:38.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Can you show me?

asr-002789
03:02:39.440 --> 03:02:41.960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: What do you mean by four tranches?

asr-002790
03:02:41.960 --> 03:02:42.460
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Anong?

asr-002791
03:02:43.180 --> 03:02:46.960
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: If at one time, in order to harmonize now the...

asr-002792
03:02:48.300 --> 03:02:59.820
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Tuition fee of all 113 SUCs and LUCs, the cost per unit is P1,212 per unit.

asr-002793
03:03:04.180 --> 03:03:15.400
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Compared to the present per unit being collected by SUC, which ranges from P12 to P500.

asr-002794
03:03:18.300 --> 03:03:27.020
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Sa details po, about P108 collects P12 to P250.

asr-002795
03:03:27.780 --> 03:03:32.500
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And about the P6 or P7, about P250.

asr-002796
03:03:33.920 --> 03:03:38.380
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So, we came up with different options, proposals.

asr-002797
03:03:39.420 --> 03:03:41.260
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Nag-compute din ang DBM.

asr-002798
03:03:41.260 --> 03:03:43.200
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Kasi po, hindi po talaga kaya.

asr-002799
03:03:43.520 --> 03:03:48.260
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: We are all aware of the limited fiscal space of the government.

asr-002800
03:03:48.300 --> 03:03:54.940
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So, CHED has its own proposal in order to have a step gap.

asr-002801
03:03:55.500 --> 03:03:56.820
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: PASUC has its own.

asr-002802
03:03:57.360 --> 03:03:58.860
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: DBM has its own.

asr-002803
03:03:59.480 --> 03:04:01.560
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And SGV, we have four proposals.

asr-002804
03:04:03.680 --> 03:04:11.580
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Which we agreed a while ago that we will form a technical working group upon the proposal of Senator Bam with EDCOM.

asr-002805
03:04:13.480 --> 03:04:17.300
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: DBM and CHED and maybe representative from PASUC.

asr-002806
03:04:17.300 --> 03:04:17.920
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: PASUC.

asr-002807
03:04:18.300 --> 03:04:26.280
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: We will come up with a win-win equation for the consideration of our Senate president.

asr-002808
03:04:27.420 --> 03:04:31.540
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Gusto ko yan, win-win solution. Gusto natin yan.

asr-002809
03:04:31.540 --> 03:04:39.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But what you're saying is, Chairperson Shirley, magiging uniform na at 1-2.

asr-002810
03:04:42.220 --> 03:04:47.240
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Ang SGV formula, Sir SP, kung kaya natin,

asr-002811
03:04:47.240 --> 03:04:51.200
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: 1,212 per unit.

asr-002812
03:04:51.460 --> 03:04:54.520
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Kaya ang proposal, para hindi mabigat sa gobyerno,

asr-002813
03:04:54.660 --> 03:04:59.700
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: para scientific, with scientific basis na yung i-implement is,

asr-002814
03:05:00.300 --> 03:05:01.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: i-divide by four.

asr-002815
03:05:02.280 --> 03:05:04.000
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Tingnan mo, divide by four. Bilis.

asr-002816
03:05:05.260 --> 03:05:07.100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: What do you mean divide by four? Meaning?

asr-002817
03:05:07.640 --> 03:05:09.160
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: For tranches, for years.

asr-002818
03:05:09.160 --> 03:05:11.880
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pagka umapot ng 1,200?

asr-002819
03:05:12.980 --> 03:05:15.320
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Per unit, divided by four.

asr-002820
03:05:15.320 --> 03:05:17.100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Buti na lang, wala na ako dito.

asr-002821
03:05:17.240 --> 03:05:19.680
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pagkatong graduate na ako nun.

asr-002822
03:05:22.120 --> 03:05:26.920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But how much are we looking at at that time?

asr-002823
03:05:27.160 --> 03:05:37.400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Obviously, pag 500, the requirement will be anything between twice to three times to four times.

asr-002824
03:05:37.620 --> 03:05:43.160
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: For 2027, if we use the SGV, we need 67.8 billion.

asr-002825
03:05:43.160 --> 03:05:47.160
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: For DBM, we need...

asr-002826
03:05:47.240 --> 03:05:52.040
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: 43.7 billion for year, for year one.

asr-002827
03:05:52.040 --> 03:06:01.040
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Year to tumataas po, for 2028, 107 billion.

asr-002828
03:06:01.720 --> 03:06:04.520
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: For 2029, 153.

asr-002829
03:06:04.760 --> 03:06:07.900
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: For 2030, 205.4 billion.

asr-002830
03:06:08.540 --> 03:06:14.120
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So that's the, that should be the million, no?

asr-002831
03:06:14.360 --> 03:06:14.880
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Billion?

asr-002832
03:06:15.020 --> 03:06:15.900
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Sir, billion po.

asr-002833
03:06:15.940 --> 03:06:16.440
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Billion?

asr-002834
03:06:16.440 --> 03:06:17.040
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Billion?

asr-002835
03:06:17.240 --> 03:06:18.240
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Magkano yung present?

asr-002849
03:06:26.740 --> 03:06:33.240
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Current FHC, na walang adjustment, 27 point billion.

asr-002850
03:06:33.240 --> 03:06:44.240
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So if you, if we use the four tranches, if we implement the result of the SGV into four tranches, that means four years.

asr-002851
03:06:44.240 --> 03:06:46.240
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yung 2027.

asr-002852
03:06:46.240 --> 03:06:46.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: 27.

asr-002853
03:06:46.740 --> 03:06:47.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: 67.

asr-002854
03:06:47.740 --> 03:06:52.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: 67 billion minus 27 yung current, we need 40 billion.

asr-002855
03:06:52.740 --> 03:06:53.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Okay.

asr-002856
03:06:53.740 --> 03:06:54.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: All right.

asr-002857
03:06:54.740 --> 03:07:02.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So from 27 billion, aakyat siya to 205 billion.

asr-002858
03:07:02.740 --> 03:07:04.240
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ito na yung full.

asr-002859
03:07:04.240 --> 03:07:05.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yes po, yung full.

asr-002860
03:07:05.740 --> 03:07:06.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Full amount.

asr-002861
03:07:06.740 --> 03:07:07.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: For four years.

asr-002862
03:07:07.740 --> 03:07:08.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yes po.

asr-002863
03:07:08.740 --> 03:07:11.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So almost times 10.

asr-002864
03:07:11.740 --> 03:07:14.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Almost times 10.

asr-002865
03:07:14.740 --> 03:07:15.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Okay.

asr-002866
03:07:15.740 --> 03:07:18.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Okay.

asr-002867
03:07:18.740 --> 03:07:24.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But since hindi pa natin ito in-implement, what formula are we using?

asr-002868
03:07:24.740 --> 03:07:35.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: The immediate remedy that we are proposing, of course, I can only speak of CHED now, is the, what we call it, leveling up.

asr-002869
03:07:35.740 --> 03:07:43.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Para po makapaglaba, makapag, so that the State University, those SUCs who collects,

asr-002870
03:07:43.740 --> 03:07:56.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: tuition fee from 12 pesos to 250, na 108 sila, kung pwede lang, iangat sila lahat hanggang 250 per unit.

asr-002871
03:07:56.740 --> 03:08:12.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yung mga nagkocollect ng 250 up, para hindi sila masyadong madihado naman, para may laban, kahit mataas na sila for how many years, tulad ni President Tirso, ay mabibigyan ng 20% increase.

asr-002872
03:08:12.740 --> 03:08:34.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So if we follow that, if we follow that po, the total projection fee collected, if we follow that proposal, ang kailangan, ang kailangan po natin for SUCs and LUKs is 14.6 billion lang.

asr-002873
03:08:34.740 --> 03:08:41.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: If you deduct the current na naiprogram na na 9 billion, we only need 5.5 billion.

asr-002874
03:08:41.740 --> 03:08:42.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Okay.

asr-002875
03:08:42.740 --> 03:08:53.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Magiging mag-benefit ang 108 SUCs who collects tuition fee from 12 pesos to 250 per unit.

asr-002876
03:08:53.740 --> 03:09:02.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And about 8, I'll give you, we can give you the right number, 8 SUCs who collects 250 and above.

asr-002877
03:09:02.740 --> 03:09:11.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That is actually changing the per unit cost.

asr-002878
03:09:11.740 --> 03:09:21.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But assuming it's still the same, but the formula we're using is projected number of students.

asr-002879
03:09:21.740 --> 03:09:23.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yes, we have the projected number.

asr-002880
03:09:23.740 --> 03:09:24.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: I would like...

asr-002881
03:09:24.740 --> 03:09:26.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yan ang pinagamit natin moving forward.

asr-002882
03:09:26.740 --> 03:09:31.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So in other words, ang punta ko lang, Ma'am Shirley, hindi na tayo magkakaroon ng utang.

asr-002883
03:09:33.740 --> 03:09:36.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Hindi na tayo magkakaroon ng deficiency.

asr-002884
03:09:36.740 --> 03:09:37.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Sir, hindi po.

asr-002885
03:09:37.740 --> 03:09:38.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Ginagamit.

asr-002886
03:09:38.740 --> 03:09:39.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Sorry.

asr-002887
03:09:39.740 --> 03:09:40.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: I stand corrected.

asr-002888
03:09:40.740 --> 03:09:44.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Hindi pa ginagamit yung itong formula ito for projection.

asr-002889
03:09:44.740 --> 03:09:49.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Ang goal lang namin sana is to elevate lang ng content.

asr-002890
03:09:49.740 --> 03:09:52.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And this only pertains to cost per unit.

asr-002891
03:09:52.740 --> 03:09:54.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yung miscellaneous ay iba pa.

asr-002892
03:09:54.740 --> 03:09:55.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Let it be that way.

asr-002893
03:09:55.740 --> 03:09:58.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Anyway, meron nang data ang SDV.

asr-002894
03:09:58.740 --> 03:10:05.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: By the time na ready ang government na i-implement, medyo okay na kasi marami nang nakaangat.

asr-002895
03:10:05.740 --> 03:10:08.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But assuming the same lang yung cost per unit.

asr-002896
03:10:08.740 --> 03:10:10.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: The same yung miscellaneous cost.

asr-002897
03:10:10.740 --> 03:10:14.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: What's different lang yung projected number of students, di ba?

asr-002898
03:10:15.740 --> 03:10:18.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi lumalaki yung number of students natin eh.

asr-002899
03:10:18.740 --> 03:10:20.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So with that, hindi na tayo...

asr-002900
03:10:20.740 --> 03:10:24.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang punta ko, hindi na tayo magkakaroon ng deficiency in the next few years.

asr-002901
03:10:24.740 --> 03:10:28.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Assuming na projected na yung gamit natin.

asr-002902
03:10:28.740 --> 03:10:29.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Tama?

asr-002903
03:10:29.740 --> 03:10:33.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi we already settled yung 12 billion deficiency.

asr-002904
03:10:33.740 --> 03:10:37.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: What we don't want is magkaroon na naman ng utang moving forward.

asr-002905
03:10:37.740 --> 03:10:38.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Mr. Chair.

asr-002906
03:10:38.740 --> 03:10:40.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: At tagutin ko muna.

asr-002907
03:10:40.740 --> 03:10:41.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yes, sir.

asr-002908
03:10:41.740 --> 03:10:43.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Nakikita ko po yung punto nyo.

asr-002909
03:10:43.740 --> 03:10:46.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: But to avoid the deficiency.

asr-002910
03:10:46.740 --> 03:10:57.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: But we can only avoid deficiency if we establish a common formula for the absorptive capacity.

asr-002911
03:10:57.740 --> 03:10:59.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Kasi may mga...

asr-002912
03:10:59.740 --> 03:11:05.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: I have the data that 68% of the 113 SUC accept students beyond...

asr-002913
03:11:05.740 --> 03:11:06.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Hmm.

asr-002914
03:11:06.740 --> 03:11:09.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Students beyond their absorptive capacity.

asr-002915
03:11:09.740 --> 03:11:11.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So we have the data.

asr-002916
03:11:11.740 --> 03:11:15.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So kailangan kaya sabi kanina, pinag-usapan kanina.

asr-002917
03:11:15.740 --> 03:11:20.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yeah, 68% exceeded their estimated enrollment capacity.

asr-002918
03:11:20.740 --> 03:11:25.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: 32% were within or below their estimated enrollment capacity.

asr-002919
03:11:25.740 --> 03:11:32.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So we really cannot project unless we have a common equation across 113 SUCs.

asr-002920
03:11:32.740 --> 03:11:33.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Oo.

asr-002921
03:11:33.740 --> 03:11:35.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ba't yung absorptive capacity niya?

asr-002922
03:11:35.740 --> 03:11:38.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Hindi naman siya kasama doon...

asr-002923
03:11:38.740 --> 03:11:43.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Binibilang na rin natin siya sa kanyang reimbursements.

asr-002924
03:11:43.740 --> 03:11:44.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Diba?

asr-002925
03:11:44.740 --> 03:11:46.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So kasama na siya eh.

asr-002926
03:11:46.740 --> 03:11:52.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So my point is number of students slash yung per unit cost, yun ang ating binabayad sa kanya.

asr-002927
03:11:52.740 --> 03:11:55.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So hindi na tayo magkaka-utang moving forward.

asr-002928
03:11:55.740 --> 03:11:57.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yun lang ang gusto ko malaman.

asr-002929
03:11:57.740 --> 03:11:58.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yes.

asr-002930
03:11:58.740 --> 03:11:59.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yes po.

asr-002931
03:11:59.740 --> 03:12:00.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Tama po.

asr-002932
03:12:00.740 --> 03:12:03.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Nag-accumulate yung utang eh.

asr-002933
03:12:03.740 --> 03:12:07.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: What we want is to stop the deficiency first.

asr-002934
03:12:07.740 --> 03:12:17.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And then after stopping the deficiency first, then we talk about the reasonable per unit cost per student.

asr-002935
03:12:17.740 --> 03:12:20.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Diba? Yun ang next move natin.

asr-002936
03:12:20.740 --> 03:12:24.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi nga iba-ibang school, iba-iba ang cost. Diba?

asr-002937
03:12:24.740 --> 03:12:28.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: May malaking school, mas malaki ang cost. Mas maliit school, mas maliit ang cost.

asr-002938
03:12:28.740 --> 03:12:32.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So pag-uusapan naman natin yan moving forward. No?

asr-002939
03:12:32.740 --> 03:12:33.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yes.

asr-002940
03:12:33.740 --> 03:12:41.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But we're not gonna have any deficiency or utang in the next, moving forward. Tama?

asr-002941
03:12:41.740 --> 03:12:42.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Tama po.

asr-002942
03:12:42.740 --> 03:12:43.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Okay. Alright.

asr-002943
03:12:43.740 --> 03:12:46.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yeah, that's what I want to cover.

asr-002944
03:12:46.740 --> 03:12:48.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Si Dr. Sorieta wants to…

asr-002945
03:12:48.740 --> 03:12:52.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Mr. Chair, to add some insight to the discussion.

asr-002946
03:12:52.740 --> 03:13:01.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Tama po kayo na kung sinusunod lang po ang allocation basis sa projected enrollment, wala pong deficiency.

asr-002947
03:13:01.740 --> 03:13:08.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Alam po ninyo sa 2027, by the time we speak, siguradong meron ng deficiency.

asr-002948
03:13:08.740 --> 03:13:17.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Kasi 46 among our SUCs now are allocated the same as the allocation for FHC in 2026.

asr-002949
03:13:17.740 --> 03:13:23.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Ngayon po, by the time we speak, meaning to say, wala na tayong room ngayon for increase.

asr-002950
03:13:23.740 --> 03:13:29.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Kasi ang budget na ibinigay sa SUC, 46 SUCs, for 2027 sa FHC,

asr-002951
03:13:29.740 --> 03:13:33.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: kuneope lang po yung budget nila ng FHC ng 2026.

asr-002952
03:13:33.740 --> 03:13:37.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So hindi pa po ginagamit, which I think that's in the special provision,

asr-002953
03:13:37.740 --> 03:13:44.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: that the allocation must be determined by the projected enrollment.

asr-002954
03:13:44.740 --> 03:13:49.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Ngayon, hindi ko rin po alam kung why DBM is not following that.

asr-002955
03:13:49.740 --> 03:13:56.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Sabi nila, ayaw nilang sundin yung binigay naming projected enrollment kasi wala raw basis.

asr-002956
03:13:56.740 --> 03:13:58.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Saan ba natin generally

asr-002957
03:13:58.740 --> 03:14:01.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: kukuhanin ang projected enrollment?

asr-002958
03:14:01.740 --> 03:14:07.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: It goes without saying that when you project enrollment, you will count the number of your chairs.

asr-002959
03:14:07.740 --> 03:14:12.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: But in counting the number of chairs, we must also count the digital chairs, the digital seats.

asr-002960
03:14:12.740 --> 03:14:16.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: It's not peg must be to the physical chairs.

asr-002961
03:14:16.740 --> 03:14:22.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: The number of teachers, or even modality, or even number of shifts.

asr-002962
03:14:22.740 --> 03:14:27.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Kung morning shifts, afternoon shifts, meron pa ding evening shifts ng klase.

asr-002963
03:14:27.740 --> 03:14:29.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Ang number of shifts, modality.

asr-002964
03:14:29.740 --> 03:14:35.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: I have some reservation on the formula being introduced to determine the absorptive capacity.

asr-002965
03:14:35.740 --> 03:14:37.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Tanong po, Mr. Chair.

asr-002966
03:14:37.740 --> 03:14:47.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Sa 10931, kasi ang aming pong reservation dyan sa absorptive capacity, baka gamitin yan as a cap of our enrollment

asr-002967
03:14:47.740 --> 03:14:51.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: if we will be counting the number of seats and the number of faculty.

asr-002968
03:14:51.740 --> 03:14:56.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Now, where shall we base our absorptive capacity?

asr-002969
03:14:56.740 --> 03:14:59.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: To our current limitation or to the demand?

asr-002970
03:15:00.000 --> 03:15:03.500
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Let's say, for example, just to give context to our discussion,

asr-002971
03:15:04.260 --> 03:15:10.360
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: this 2025, there are 1.3 million students who sought admission to our SUCs.

asr-002972
03:15:10.820 --> 03:15:19.520
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: And only 500,000 were admitted, meaning we were not able to admit 800,000 students.

asr-002973
03:15:20.700 --> 03:15:25.120
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Now, if we will be stretching our capacity, let's say, for example, a bit,

asr-002974
03:15:25.800 --> 03:15:27.400
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: baka maging 600,000 sana.

asr-002975
03:15:27.400 --> 03:15:33.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Now, let's say, for example, ako last year, my enrollment, let's say, for example, is 60,000.

asr-002976
03:15:34.240 --> 03:15:40.020
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Maybe it's safe for me to say na I can stretch by finding more or looking for more faculty.

asr-002977
03:15:40.600 --> 03:15:45.140
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: I may endeavor to find more chairs next school year.

asr-002978
03:15:45.900 --> 03:15:50.020
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: I should not be limited by my last year's number of chairs.

asr-002979
03:15:50.820 --> 03:15:55.880
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: I must not be limited by my last year's number of teachers because I can hire teachers.

asr-002980
03:15:57.400 --> 03:16:00.100
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Because of the smart campuses that we have now,

asr-002981
03:16:00.260 --> 03:16:04.140
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: some of our SUCs can deliberate blended to increase the capacity.

asr-002982
03:16:04.840 --> 03:16:07.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: I have some opportunity to talk to, let's say, Arizona State.

asr-002983
03:16:08.420 --> 03:16:10.700
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: And I asked them, what is your number of students?

asr-002984
03:16:11.740 --> 03:16:16.260
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: He told me, for those degree-seeking, we have 200,000 students

asr-002985
03:16:16.260 --> 03:16:22.220
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: because we believe that our online classes are as effective as the face-to-face classes.

asr-002986
03:16:22.720 --> 03:16:26.040
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: And those non-degree-seeking, or let's say, conventional or non-conventional,

asr-002987
03:16:26.040 --> 03:16:27.380
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: they have 500,000.

asr-002988
03:16:27.400 --> 03:16:31.440
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So, they are not only considering the number of seats.

asr-002989
03:16:32.300 --> 03:16:37.120
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Be that as it may, Mr. Chair, I think, dapat na sinusunod pa rin ng DBM

asr-002990
03:16:37.120 --> 03:16:39.200
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: kung anong piniroject nating enrollment.

asr-002991
03:16:39.980 --> 03:16:42.600
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Siguro naman, walang magpuproject sa atin ng masyadong malaki

asr-002992
03:16:42.600 --> 03:16:46.960
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: kasi hindi mo din siya masisingil because the reimbursement is based on actual enrollment.

asr-002993
03:16:47.740 --> 03:16:51.640
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: If, let's say, for example, I have miscalculation, I have 1,000 enrollees now.

asr-002994
03:16:52.100 --> 03:16:55.720
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: I projected, let's say, I have 1,050 next year.

asr-002995
03:16:56.360 --> 03:16:57.380
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Now, in actuality, I have 1,000 enrollees now.

asr-002996
03:16:57.400 --> 03:16:59.000
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: In actual, I only have 1,040.

asr-002997
03:16:59.820 --> 03:17:05.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So, hindi naman ako babayaran ng 1,050 because the payment is based on the actual enrollment.

asr-002998
03:17:06.580 --> 03:17:11.660
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: There may be some differences in allocation or in projection.

asr-002999
03:17:12.360 --> 03:17:15.240
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: What I'm saying is, maybe, baka pwedeng maglagay nila ng cap.

asr-003000
03:17:15.740 --> 03:17:21.400
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Let's say, wala sa ating tataas ng 5%, rule of thumb, or let's say 3%.

asr-003001
03:17:21.400 --> 03:17:24.000
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So, kung ikaw yung mag-i-stretch, let's say, for example,

asr-003002
03:17:24.000 --> 03:17:27.200
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: ng number of seats, number of teachers, number of shifts,

asr-003003
03:17:27.400 --> 03:17:29.900
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: so, I think, hindi mo na rin lalampasan dapat.

asr-003004
03:17:30.140 --> 03:17:31.620
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: I think, we must agree on that.

asr-003005
03:17:32.360 --> 03:17:34.540
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Ang masakit, Mr. Chair, sinabi ko nga po kanina,

asr-003006
03:17:35.440 --> 03:17:39.620
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: 46 lang HUC ngayon, same lang ang allocation ng FHC.

asr-003007
03:17:39.880 --> 03:17:41.060
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So, for sure, deficiency ngayon.

asr-003008
03:17:42.140 --> 03:17:45.120
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So, mukhang hindi natitigil, nakakaya namang sabihin,

asr-003009
03:17:45.260 --> 03:17:48.400
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: taon-taon na po, Mr. Chair, ang ating usapan, deficiency.

asr-003010
03:17:48.980 --> 03:17:51.880
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: If we're saying that education is the first priority of this Constitution,

asr-003011
03:17:52.320 --> 03:17:55.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: in our Constitution, I think, we must not allow deficiency.

asr-003012
03:17:55.740 --> 03:17:55.860
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Okay?

asr-003013
03:17:57.400 --> 03:17:58.120
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: In higher education.

asr-003014
03:17:59.580 --> 03:18:01.720
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: That's our submission, Mr. Chair. Thank you.

asr-003015
03:18:02.920 --> 03:18:05.920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pero, di ba ang computation ngayon, based on projected?

asr-003016
03:18:06.700 --> 03:18:07.240
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Hindi po.

asr-003017
03:18:07.780 --> 03:18:08.420
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Hindi sinunod.

asr-003018
03:18:08.440 --> 03:18:12.300
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That's in the special provision.

asr-003019
03:18:13.040 --> 03:18:13.260
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Di ba?

asr-003020
03:18:13.900 --> 03:18:15.060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Tama po, pinalagyan natin yan.

asr-003021
03:18:15.080 --> 03:18:22.500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: For example, for your 2027 enrollment, projection nyo, yun ang pupunduhan.

asr-003022
03:18:23.080 --> 03:18:23.300
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Di ba?

asr-003023
03:18:23.480 --> 03:18:24.840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That's in the special provision.

asr-003024
03:18:24.840 --> 03:18:25.320
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Apo.

asr-003025
03:18:25.480 --> 03:18:26.160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kung di nga.

asr-003026
03:18:26.280 --> 03:18:26.760
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kung di ma.

asr-003027
03:18:27.400 --> 03:18:29.720
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Itong deficiency, hindi matatapos eh.

asr-003028
03:18:29.880 --> 03:18:30.280
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Tama po.

asr-003029
03:18:30.320 --> 03:18:31.860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, hindi ba ganun ang...

asr-003030
03:18:31.860 --> 03:18:32.660
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Hindi po.

asr-003031
03:18:32.740 --> 03:18:33.940
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang part of the calculation?

asr-003032
03:18:34.140 --> 03:18:34.900
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Thank you.

asr-003033
03:18:37.400 --> 03:18:37.960
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yeah.

asr-003034
03:18:38.360 --> 03:18:44.040
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Enrollment projection, I believe, is a function of the absorptive capacity of university.

asr-003035
03:18:44.740 --> 03:18:52.140
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And when we talk of the absorptive capacity of SUC, it is played by different variables.

asr-003036
03:18:52.920 --> 03:18:55.040
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Number one is the student-faculty ratio.

asr-003037
03:18:55.240 --> 03:18:57.240
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Number two is the number of classes.

asr-003038
03:18:57.400 --> 03:19:01.000
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Classrooms, availability, and laboratory, and others po.

asr-003039
03:19:01.000 --> 03:19:17.520
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: The absorptive capacity formula should be solved first before we can come up with an ideal projection, Mr. Surespy.

asr-003040
03:19:17.520 --> 03:19:26.520
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So, kailangan po, siguro po, para hindi po magdidiscuss ng kung paano gagawin ang enrollment projection.

asr-003041
03:19:27.400 --> 03:19:36.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: We first settle on the formula how to have the proper equation for enrollment projection po.

asr-003042
03:19:37.320 --> 03:19:38.320
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Iba-iba po kasi.

asr-003043
03:19:38.320 --> 03:19:48.420
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Ang isang university has a faculty-student ratio of one faculty to 60, may one is to 25, one is to 30, one is to 40.

asr-003044
03:19:49.040 --> 03:19:56.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Kaya po, yung aming computation with DBM, yung initial kasi na kinumpute namin noon,

asr-003045
03:19:57.400 --> 03:20:01.280
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: doon tayo ng deficiency ng 12 point something billion deficiency.

asr-003046
03:20:01.780 --> 03:20:06.900
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: We base it from a 1 is to 25 student-faculty ratio.

asr-003047
03:20:08.400 --> 03:20:16.600
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Pero may kaya yung mga 1 is to 60, 1 is to 70, talagang malaki yung discrepancy niya, Mr. S.P.

asr-003048
03:20:18.980 --> 03:20:21.460
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Kailangan na kasi ayusin yung formula.

asr-003049
03:20:22.360 --> 03:20:25.860
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Pero, Julia, sabi naman si Patlas, parameters lang, hindi naman kailangan ng formula.

asr-003050
03:20:27.400 --> 03:20:38.700
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi ang goal ko kasi wala, moving forward, huwag na tayo magkaroon ng deficiency, kundi hindi matatapos kasi itong problema eh.

asr-003051
03:20:39.520 --> 03:20:45.540
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, and the only way we can do it is dapat projections ang gamit.

asr-003052
03:20:49.420 --> 03:20:50.400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But I…

asr-003053
03:20:51.400 --> 03:20:53.060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Can you see the special provision?

asr-003054
03:20:53.360 --> 03:20:53.720
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yes, sir.

asr-003055
03:20:55.820 --> 03:20:57.020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you.

asr-003056
03:20:57.400 --> 03:21:01.860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And the question of absorptive capacity, malaking debate yan.

asr-003057
03:21:02.680 --> 03:21:15.040
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, we'll leave the question of absorptive capacity to Ched to ano, kasi malaking debate yan.

asr-003058
03:21:15.180 --> 03:21:17.080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Like, I'm looking at some of the increases.

asr-003059
03:21:17.080 --> 03:21:27.080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Like, for example, sa CAR, sa Cordillera, ang increase ng enrollment is 147%.

asr-003060
03:21:27.400 --> 03:21:30.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Sa Caraga, 109%.

asr-003061
03:21:30.560 --> 03:21:33.840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Western Visayas, 104%.

asr-003062
03:21:33.840 --> 03:21:36.840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Of course, masaya tayo na may araming students nag-aaral.

asr-003063
03:21:37.460 --> 03:21:37.620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Diba?

asr-003064
03:21:37.760 --> 03:21:41.520
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But we also want to make sure na quality yung tinuturo natin sa kanila.

asr-003065
03:21:42.340 --> 03:21:56.580
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, and when I say quality, malaking discussion yan within Ched whether to allow online classes or hybrid classes.

asr-003066
03:21:57.400 --> 03:21:59.700
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Or pure face-to-face classes.

asr-003067
03:21:59.900 --> 03:22:01.000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I'll leave that to you.

asr-003068
03:22:01.100 --> 03:22:05.460
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi malaking debate yan eh.

asr-003069
03:22:09.200 --> 03:22:17.280
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Para sa akin, what's important for now, at least for this budget hearing, hindi na tayo magkaroon ng deficiency moving forward.

asr-003070
03:22:18.220 --> 03:22:25.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Now, how to compute your capacity, your absorptive capacity or carrying capacity?

asr-003071
03:22:27.400 --> 03:22:28.960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I iiwang ko yan sa Ched.

asr-003072
03:22:29.060 --> 03:22:31.980
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That's a policy issue that you have to discuss among yourselves.

asr-003073
03:22:32.360 --> 03:22:34.500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi malaking debate yan.

asr-003074
03:22:34.760 --> 03:22:41.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kung ako tatanungin, in our setting, face-to-face is still the best.

asr-003075
03:22:43.560 --> 03:22:49.100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But sabi nga ni Dr. Tears, so may mga, baka may mga courses na pwedeng hybrid.

asr-003076
03:22:49.700 --> 03:22:51.100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But I'll leave that to Ched.

asr-003077
03:22:51.520 --> 03:22:53.480
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Because that's a policy issue.

asr-003078
03:22:53.480 --> 03:22:57.380
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, what's important for us is hindi na maulit yung deficiency.

asr-003079
03:22:57.400 --> 03:23:04.700
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But I understand dito sa DBM, na ginagamit pa rin nila actual billing.

asr-003080
03:23:06.520 --> 03:23:08.580
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Nandito ba yung ano natin sa DBM?

asr-003081
03:23:10.860 --> 03:23:13.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: This is the general provision, this one.

asr-003082
03:23:18.240 --> 03:23:19.500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Take the seat.

asr-003083
03:23:20.720 --> 03:23:21.760
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Can you take the hot seat?

asr-003084
03:23:22.940 --> 03:23:26.040
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi mali yung ginagawa ninyo eh, DBM.

asr-003087
03:23:27.400 --> 03:23:31.960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi dito sa formula na gamit nyo is actual 2025 billing.

asr-003088
03:23:32.740 --> 03:23:45.700
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But in the general provision, this is a special provision too.

asr-003089
03:23:46.220 --> 03:23:51.060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: In the special provision, shall be based on projected enrollment.

asr-003090
03:23:52.320 --> 03:23:57.140
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Very clear dito. Bakit ginagamit pa rin ay actual billing?

asr-003091
03:23:57.400 --> 03:24:01.600
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yes, go ahead, ma'am.

asr-003092
03:24:01.860 --> 03:24:04.500
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: Mr. Chair, Your Honor, if I may.

asr-003093
03:24:05.280 --> 03:24:09.160
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: Actually po, it's not only the actual billing po.

asr-003094
03:24:09.480 --> 03:24:15.580
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: In addition po, meron po yung three-year average increase po in the number of enrollees sa computation.

asr-003095
03:24:18.780 --> 03:24:21.620
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: Bali, increase in the number of enrollees po.

asr-003096
03:24:22.960 --> 03:24:24.720
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, capture na yun.

asr-003097
03:24:24.960 --> 03:24:25.340
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: Opo.

asr-003098
03:24:25.340 --> 03:24:27.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Three-year average increase.

asr-003099
03:24:27.400 --> 03:24:27.840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Increase.

asr-003100
03:24:27.920 --> 03:24:29.080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But this is in the past.

asr-003101
03:24:30.060 --> 03:24:30.200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Oo.

asr-003102
03:24:30.900 --> 03:24:32.060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Diba, in the past.

asr-003103
03:24:32.120 --> 03:24:32.620
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: Yes po, average.

asr-003104
03:24:32.820 --> 03:24:37.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Hindi pa rin yan yung nasa batas na based on projected enrollment.

asr-003105
03:24:38.840 --> 03:24:41.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Diba, iba naman yung historical, diba?

asr-003106
03:24:42.480 --> 03:24:44.000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Iba naman yung moving forward.

asr-003107
03:24:44.660 --> 03:24:48.040
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Let's say, may nagpatayo siya ng bagong classroom, bagong building.

asr-003108
03:24:48.880 --> 03:24:50.900
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Siyempre, hindi maka-capture yun ng historical.

asr-003109
03:24:51.460 --> 03:24:53.380
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: Of non-admission of projection.

asr-003110
03:24:53.820 --> 03:24:55.020
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: We have no choice but to.

asr-003111
03:24:55.640 --> 03:24:56.500
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: Yes po.

asr-003112
03:24:57.400 --> 03:25:05.440
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: Actually po, Mr. Chair, in the absence po of the submission po from CHED for the projected po.

asr-003113
03:25:05.440 --> 03:25:10.960
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: So, we have to be constrained po using this formula.

asr-003114
03:25:11.960 --> 03:25:16.660
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Just to put on record, it's a violation of the special provision ha.

asr-003115
03:25:17.380 --> 03:25:19.680
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Itong ginagamit yung formula for this year.

asr-003116
03:25:22.280 --> 03:25:26.540
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: Bali po yung formula will be the FY 2025.

asr-003117
03:25:26.540 --> 03:25:34.480
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: Actual billing plus 3-year average increase in the number of enrollees times the cost per student.

asr-003118
03:25:35.420 --> 03:25:40.440
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: So, yung increase in the number of enrollees, ito na po yung magiging projected number po.

asr-003119
03:25:41.320 --> 03:25:46.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Diba, but that's not the, hindi nga yun yung essence nitong special provision.

asr-003120
03:25:46.580 --> 03:25:51.900
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang essence nitong special provision, ano yung tingin nilang magiging enrollment nila sa following year?

asr-003121
03:25:53.540 --> 03:25:54.140
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Diba po.

asr-003122
03:25:54.140 --> 03:25:55.940
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi nga, we want to correct yung.

asr-003123
03:25:55.940 --> 03:25:58.200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang deficiency, ano yung nagiging issue eh.

asr-003124
03:25:59.400 --> 03:25:59.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: No?

asr-003125
03:26:00.420 --> 03:26:01.980
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: Yeah, we are still having people from.

asr-003126
03:26:01.980 --> 03:26:05.680
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Umalik tayo sa dati, so ibig sabihin magkakautang ulit tayo.

asr-003127
03:26:05.920 --> 03:26:06.360
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: Submission from CHED.

asr-003128
03:26:06.360 --> 03:26:07.220
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Hindi matatapos to.

asr-003129
03:26:07.280 --> 03:26:08.820
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: What we want is to finish this eh.

asr-003130
03:26:10.980 --> 03:26:11.680
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yes po.

asr-003131
03:26:13.860 --> 03:26:19.040
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: As impatient as you are now, we have started communicating with DBM now.

asr-003132
03:26:19.180 --> 03:26:23.520
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And we are very thankful that Secretary Kim is open to all our suggestion.

asr-003133
03:26:23.520 --> 03:26:25.700
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: That's why moving forward.

asr-003134
03:26:25.940 --> 03:26:36.660
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: We will be creating now, CHED will spearhead the creation of technical working group that will involve the, that will involve EDCOM already.

asr-003135
03:26:36.660 --> 03:26:45.440
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: DBM, EDCOM, and then maybe resource person from PASOP who will provide the data and everything.

asr-003136
03:26:45.440 --> 03:26:48.220
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Maybe hindi lang po resource person, baka pwedeng member.

asr-003137
03:26:52.660 --> 03:26:53.920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pinakamaganda dito.

asr-003138
03:26:53.920 --> 03:26:54.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Um.

asr-003139
03:26:54.420 --> 03:26:57.240
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang pag-usapan ng PASOP and CHED.

asr-003140
03:26:57.320 --> 03:26:57.840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: How do you.

asr-003141
03:26:59.020 --> 03:26:59.360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi.

asr-003142
03:27:00.740 --> 03:27:04.980
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang DBM naman, they look at the numbers eh.

asr-003143
03:27:05.600 --> 03:27:05.800
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: No?

asr-003144
03:27:05.880 --> 03:27:07.300
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And they follow the guidelines.

asr-003145
03:27:08.160 --> 03:27:12.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, in the absence of, I think it's absence of a guideline.

asr-003146
03:27:13.120 --> 03:27:15.140
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Hindi nila alam kung anong numbers ang titignan.

asr-003147
03:27:15.580 --> 03:27:18.980
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, by default, tinignan nila yung dating numbers.

asr-003148
03:27:18.980 --> 03:27:19.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: No?

asr-003149
03:27:19.500 --> 03:27:24.260
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But, let me just flag DBM.

asr-003150
03:27:24.420 --> 03:27:26.040
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Na projection ang gamit dito.

asr-003151
03:27:26.900 --> 03:27:27.100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: No?

asr-003152
03:27:27.300 --> 03:27:27.780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Um.

asr-003153
03:27:27.840 --> 03:27:31.480
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: In the special provision number 4 for SUCs.

asr-003154
03:27:35.140 --> 03:27:35.700
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Oo.

asr-003155
03:27:35.820 --> 03:27:43.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, dapat kung anong tingin nilang enrollment nila this coming 2027, yun ang susundan.

asr-003156
03:27:44.560 --> 03:27:45.520
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yun ang susundan.

asr-003157
03:27:47.540 --> 03:27:48.500
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Mr. Chair.

asr-003158
03:27:48.720 --> 03:27:48.940
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Yeah.

asr-003159
03:27:49.320 --> 03:27:53.280
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Though we learned that already this discussion sa Congress, I think two days ago.

asr-003160
03:27:54.080 --> 03:27:54.240
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: The.

asr-003161
03:27:54.420 --> 03:28:03.460
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Shared formula adapted by DBM, as I also shared with your observation, I think it's not logically as correct as we expect.

asr-003162
03:28:03.860 --> 03:28:10.180
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Because if that will be an increase relative to the average of the past three years increases, you are correct.

asr-003163
03:28:10.280 --> 03:28:13.220
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: It's not really projecting the future enrollment.

asr-003164
03:28:13.800 --> 03:28:14.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: There are many formulas.

asr-003165
03:28:14.980 --> 03:28:17.280
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: I think let's not make ourselves too difficult about it.

asr-003166
03:28:17.280 --> 03:28:21.920
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: If that's annual growth rate, exponential decay or growth formula, is population increase.

asr-003167
03:28:22.340 --> 03:28:23.240
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: It's not too.

asr-003168
03:28:23.240 --> 03:28:24.340
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: It's not too difficult.

asr-003169
03:28:24.340 --> 03:28:27.220
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: It's not too difficult to to use the annual growth rate formula, exponential.

asr-003170
03:28:27.780 --> 03:28:43.460
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Now, sabi ko nga po, kung lumabis ka ng konti, ang serious na yung galing mo naman sa DBM is actual, hindi ka pwedeng bigyan ng ayon sa projection mong lumabis ng konti, we will be giving them the actual enrollment, at doon kami babayadaan.

asr-003171
03:28:44.100 --> 03:28:46.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So that's that's really bugging us, Mr. Chair.

asr-003172
03:28:46.740 --> 03:28:57.400
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Katulad po ngayon, sabi ko nga kanina, there are 40 of us, 46 rather, na kinopya lang kung anong budget allocation nung 2026, copy lang ngayon.

asr-003174
03:28:57.400 --> 03:28:58.300
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So tama po kayo.

asr-003175
03:28:58.340 --> 03:29:04.740
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So tama po kayo, it's a technical, more or less non-compliance of what was written in the GAA.

asr-003176
03:29:05.140 --> 03:29:07.640
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: That's what we are always wondering about.

asr-003177
03:29:07.980 --> 03:29:14.800
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Baka po pwede, Mr. Chair, ang proposal namin, pwede pa ngayon, kasi taon-taon naman kami nagsasubmit sa DBM ng projected enrollment namin eh.

asr-003178
03:29:16.540 --> 03:29:19.300
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: At yung aming PRA doon binabasin, ina-approve ni board.

asr-003179
03:29:19.300 --> 03:29:22.500
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: At yun ang aming pinapadala sa DBM, kasi that's also in the law.

asr-003180
03:29:22.500 --> 03:29:29.940
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: That the PRA, as approved by the board, determined by the projected enrollment, will be endorsed by the DBM for funding.

asr-003181
03:29:30.480 --> 03:29:32.920
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: So baka pwede itiwala na sa SUC ang pagpuproject?

asr-003182
03:29:33.340 --> 03:29:35.060
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Kasi hindi po kami pare-pare ng situation.

asr-003183
03:29:35.960 --> 03:29:38.540
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: May SUC na may maraming space.

asr-003184
03:29:39.400 --> 03:29:40.680
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Halimbawa, depende rin sa subject.

asr-003185
03:29:41.440 --> 03:29:43.200
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Pwede 1 is to 100 pa nga eh.

asr-003186
03:29:43.260 --> 03:29:48.400
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Let's say sa mga big classes, kung ang klase mo social science, you have not all subjects.

asr-003187
03:29:48.400 --> 03:29:52.400
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: But still, I think we have distinct differences sa bawat SUC.

asr-003188
03:29:52.500 --> 03:29:56.660
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Sa maliit na klase, let's say less than 15, baka conference room pwede.

asr-003189
03:29:56.980 --> 03:29:57.600
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Hindi sa classroom.

asr-003190
03:29:58.160 --> 03:29:59.780
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: But when I count the projected enrollment,

asr-003191
03:29:59.780 --> 03:29:59.880
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: I don't know.

asr-003192
03:30:00.000 --> 03:30:05.460
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Those are considered, at hindi po yan pwedeng standard ng isang formula.

asr-003193
03:30:05.880 --> 03:30:15.840
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: We can have parameters determined to be considered, but to standardize with a formula, I think is also not acceptable because we are situated differently.

asr-003194
03:30:16.360 --> 03:30:17.120
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-003195
03:30:17.120 --> 03:30:22.040
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Mr. Chair, last two weeks, we have a consultation.

asr-003196
03:30:22.040 --> 03:30:37.900
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: We have a 13-pages proposal of the guidelines for the proposed guidelines on determining the enrollment capacity of state universities and colleges and CHED-recognized local universities and colleges.

asr-003197
03:30:38.420 --> 03:30:39.720
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: That was two weeks ago.

asr-003198
03:30:40.360 --> 03:30:46.020
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Pero both Alko and Paso did not agree.

asr-003199
03:30:46.760 --> 03:30:48.000
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: You did not agree.

asr-003200
03:30:48.600 --> 03:30:50.000
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: We agreed not to agree.

asr-003201
03:30:50.000 --> 03:30:51.600
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Agree.

asr-003202
03:30:52.040 --> 03:30:54.960
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And kaya po, masakit na talaga.

asr-003203
03:30:55.380 --> 03:31:01.000
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: But we are really becoming so tuliro na what to follow.

asr-003204
03:31:01.420 --> 03:31:05.420
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Totoo po na by law, yung projected enrollment ang kailangan.

asr-003205
03:31:06.160 --> 03:31:11.600
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: But no SUC should just freely project what they need.

asr-003206
03:31:11.660 --> 03:31:15.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: It should be guided by guidelines and a common equation.

asr-003207
03:31:15.740 --> 03:31:21.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Among the parameters that we propose in this is that the faculty-student ratio.

asr-003208
03:31:22.040 --> 03:31:26.960
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: We have to agree if it is 1 is to 25 or 1 is to 40.

asr-003209
03:31:26.960 --> 03:31:32.220
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Another factor or variable that should be considered is the classroom size.

asr-003210
03:31:32.220 --> 03:31:34.840
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: The maximum 40 students.

asr-003211
