asr-003221
03:32:03.880 --> 03:32:04.780
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: That is possible.

asr-003222
03:32:05.480 --> 03:32:07.020
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So we will input that.

asr-003223
03:32:07.120 --> 03:32:10.200
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: I hope that after including that suggestion

asr-003224
03:32:10.200 --> 03:32:12.120
