Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Utang na naman.

asr-003238
03:32:45.920 --> 03:32:47.280
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yun ang sinasabi ko eh.

asr-003239
03:32:48.160 --> 03:32:48.280
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kakabayad.

asr-003240
03:32:48.460 --> 03:32:49.400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kakabayad lang natin.

asr-003241
03:32:49.720 --> 03:32:50.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: May utang na naman.

asr-003242
03:32:51.160 --> 03:32:52.960
