Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Sisingilin namin si DBM ng additional 10%.

asr-003270
03:34:03.200 --> 03:34:04.380
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Hindi naman pwede rin ganun.

asr-003271
03:34:05.120 --> 03:34:10.140
