asr-003273
03:34:14.420 --> 03:34:15.380
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Hindi naman pwedeng ganun.

asr-003274
03:34:16.320 --> 03:34:18.140
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So hindi pwedeng arbitrary.

asr-003275
03:34:18.220 --> 03:34:19.200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I know what you're saying eh.

asr-003276
03:34:19.360 --> 03:34:21.360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But we will leave that to CHED.

asr-003277
03:34:21.480 --> 03:34:29.400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That policy, how to compute your carrying capacity, what courses can be done hybrid or online,

asr-003278
03:34:29.400 --> 03:34:30.980
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: we will leave that to CHED.

asr-003279
03:34:31.420 --> 03:34:35.140
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But what we're concerned, kasi budget to, is hindi na magkaroon ng utang.

asr-003280
