asr-003286
03:35:02.860 --> 03:35:05.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kayong tatlo na mag-usap-usap how to operationalize this.

asr-003287
03:35:05.640 --> 03:35:14.120
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But as far as we are concerned, we've allocated 4 billion, we put the special provision, yun ang aming deliverables.

