Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And then, it can also create this perverse incentive na taasan natin yung ating enrollment.

asr-003308
03:36:43.900 --> 03:36:47.620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi mas mataas yung makukuhang free hire subsidy.

asr-003309
03:36:47.620 --> 03:36:47.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yeah.

asr-003310
03:36:48.220 --> 03:36:48.780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: For our education.

asr-003311
03:36:48.960 --> 03:36:50.040
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So hindi pwede rin ganon.

asr-003312
03:36:50.680 --> 03:36:51.880
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But we leave that to Ched.

asr-003313
03:36:51.940 --> 03:36:55.500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That's a policy issue that Ched should address.

asr-003314
03:36:56.080 --> 03:36:56.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yeah.

asr-003315
03:36:56.880 --> 03:36:57.480
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Thank you.

