CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: As I've mentioned,

asr-003334
03:37:47.800 --> 03:37:48.200
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: kunang...

asr-003335
03:37:48.200 --> 03:37:49.000
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: wala pa kayo,

asr-003336
03:37:49.400 --> 03:37:58.040
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: we have a 13-pages guidelines on the enrollment projection or absorptive capacity.

asr-003337
03:37:58.500 --> 03:38:00.960
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: If we can expedite, we are no longer...

asr-003338
03:38:00.960 --> 03:38:03.240
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: we will not starting from zero anymore.

asr-003339
03:38:03.900 --> 03:38:10.840
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: If PASUC and ALCU will come to a common agreement already,

asr-003340
03:38:10.840 --> 03:38:13.480
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: baka mahabol natin for 2027.

asr-003341
03:38:18.200 --> 03:38:35.380
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, yeah, we will create a task force into how we can address this very challenging issue.

asr-003342
03:38:35.380 --> 03:38:47.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: But at least for next year, if we can put up a provision in Daga'a para masiguro natin na hindi maulit yung ginakaharap natin yan.

asr-003343
03:38:48.200 --> 03:38:52.080
Senator Joel Villanueva: I will continue to give the floor to our SP, unless...

asr-003344
03:38:52.080 --> 03:38:53.200
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Mr. Chair?

asr-003345
03:38:53.200 --> 03:38:53.700
Senator Joel Villanueva: Yes?

asr-003346
03:38:53.700 --> 03:38:55.080
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Pakisingit ng konti.

asr-003347
03:38:55.080 --> 03:38:55.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sure.

asr-003348
03:38:55.640 --> 03:38:57.440
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: I have a manifestation.

asr-003349
03:38:57.880 --> 03:39:01.540
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: This year, DBM released the ROS-2.

asr-003350
03:39:01.540 --> 03:39:02.560
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: ROS-2?

asr-003351
03:39:02.560 --> 03:39:09.140
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: For the plantilla position for research plantilla position.

asr-003352
03:39:09.520 --> 03:39:12.520
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And it is now being implemented.

asr-003353
03:39:12.520 --> 03:39:17.360
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: By law kung ang research center is created by law,

asr-003354
03:39:17.360 --> 03:39:17.560
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Okay.

asr-003355
03:39:17.560 --> 03:39:22.120
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: The university is entitled to a 25-plantilia position.

asr-003356
03:39:23.180 --> 03:39:31.300
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: If it is BOR approved, tatlong research center ay mabibigyan ng 25-plantilia position.

asr-003357
03:39:31.580 --> 03:39:32.400
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Tama po yun.

asr-003358
03:39:32.400 --> 03:39:40.200
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So lahat ng mga SUC ay nagkakaroon na as long as they have a verified research center.

asr-003359
03:39:40.200 --> 03:39:50.540
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Being the chair of CHED and oversee this 113 SUCs through our commissioners,

asr-003360
03:39:50.640 --> 03:40:00.240
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: ang nakikita namin po kung walang funding ng research as a seed fund to run the research center,

asr-003361
03:40:00.360 --> 03:40:04.480
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: magiging white elephant ang research centers.

asr-003362
03:40:05.060 --> 03:40:07.860
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So may marami tayong white elephant clerk.

asr-003363
03:40:08.900 --> 03:40:10.080
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So kung possible lang,

asr-003364
03:40:10.200 --> 03:40:17.540
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: just like what Senator Wyn Gatchalian did in our National Bioenergy Research and Innovation Center,

asr-003365
03:40:17.540 --> 03:40:24.880
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: which is now a very progressive and dynamic research center for biofuel,

asr-003366
03:40:25.120 --> 03:40:29.040
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: we also developed the Professional Science Masters in Renewable Energy

asr-003367
03:40:29.040 --> 03:40:36.860
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: with that 5 million seed fund that Senator Wyn has inserted before.

asr-003368
03:40:37.360 --> 03:40:39.540
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So continuing po na may 5 million na nagpapaikot,

asr-003369
03:40:40.200 --> 03:40:44.140
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: to cover the MOOE and basic researches under the center.

asr-003370
03:40:44.780 --> 03:40:51.720
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So kung pwede po, na yung 113 SUCs ay mabigyan ng TIG for 5 million pesos lang

asr-003371
03:40:51.720 --> 03:40:56.480
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: to start to run their center just like we did in NBERIC.

asr-003372
03:40:56.740 --> 03:41:01.060
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: That will only require 565 million pesos.

asr-003373
03:41:10.200 --> 03:41:17.080
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So bahala na po yung SUC kung paano niya gagpapaikotin?

asr-003374
03:41:18.040 --> 03:41:19.060
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Prioritize niya.

